WEBVTT

00:00:22.770 --> 00:00:26.940
I finally... managed to get here... Ace.

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:36.070
Look at this. Luffy started to make his way
to become the King of the Pirates again.

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:39.140
That's our younger brother!

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:40.410
THE STRAW HATS ARE BACK

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.070
It's so ironic.

00:00:53.710 --> 00:00:59.200
Since you've been gone, the old
memories keep recurring to me vividly.

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.540
You're too slow, Luffy!
We'll leave you behind!

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:07.930
Wait, Ace!

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:10.200
Come on, Luffy!

00:01:24.490 --> 00:01:27.120
Oh, Ace! There's a ship!

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:30.190
Hey! Hey!

00:01:30.190 --> 00:01:32.940
You idiot!
They can't hear you from this far.

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:35.570
Hey!

00:01:36.050 --> 00:01:39.430
GOA KINGDOM - 12 YEARS AGO

00:01:36.310 --> 00:01:39.450
We gotta set out to sea someday!

00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:43.070
Let's get out of this country
and live freely!

00:01:43.100 --> 00:01:47.350
I'm gonna become a pirate and
defeat all the others and become

00:01:47.350 --> 00:01:49.790
the most notorious pirate in the world!

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:54.380
I'm gonna become...!

00:01:58.240 --> 00:02:00.950
We can become brothers
if we exchange this cup of sake!

00:02:03.370 --> 00:02:06.200
So from now on, we're brothers!

00:02:06.540 --> 00:02:07.560
Yeah!!

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:11.520
Ace! What should we do today?!

00:02:11.880 --> 00:02:15.150
Fight a bear!
Let's beat the big bear of Mt. Corvo!

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:21.490
Hey! Wait! Sabo! Ace!

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:25.830
I said wait! Ace!

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:27.700
Ace!

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:30.520
Ace!!

00:02:36.310 --> 00:02:37.170
Ace!!

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:38.340
Luffy!!

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:42.240
Wait for me, Ace!
I'll be there soon!

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:46.620
MARINEFORD - TWO YEARS AGO

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:55.880
Don't get in my way!

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:58.620
Don't let him through!

00:03:01.940 --> 00:03:03.490
Gum-Gum...

00:03:03.490 --> 00:03:05.970
...Bazooka!

00:03:15.100 --> 00:03:17.040
Stay away, Luffy!

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:23.910
I know that you know it! We're both pirates!

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:26.790
We both sailed on the sea as we liked!

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:32.990
A wimp like you wants to save me?!

00:03:32.990 --> 00:03:34.730
It's so humiliating!

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:37.520
Go back, Luffy!
Why did you come here?!

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:40.610
I'm your brother!

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:45.200
Giant Rifle!

00:03:45.930 --> 00:03:48.070
Ace!!

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:50.740
You can say whatever you want!

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:53.330
I'm gonna save you even if it means death!

00:03:57.730 --> 00:03:59.320
Ace!

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:03.150
I'm a vice admiral of the Navy HQ!

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:08.340
If you wanna pass through here,
you have to kill me first! Straw Hat Luffy!

00:04:08.490 --> 00:04:09.390
Grandpa!

00:04:09.490 --> 00:04:10.310
Old man!

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:16.940
Luffy! Both you and Ace have to become
the strongest Navy soldiers!

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:21.250
Ugh, spit! Gross!

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:23.130
Who are you?!

00:04:23.430 --> 00:04:25.320
Oh! Ace!

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:27.360
Are you back, Ace?

00:04:30.430 --> 00:04:34.680
This is Ace. He's three years older than you.

00:04:34.680 --> 00:04:36.210
Be nice!

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:43.170
Because of the path you
two have chosen to live!!

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:45.920
I can't do it, grandpa!
Move out of my way!

00:04:46.070 --> 00:04:49.050
Luffy, I consider you my enemy!

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:58.480
Ace!

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:00.520
You're so...!

00:05:00.760 --> 00:05:04.940
Wait! You can't get away from me!

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:06.610
Gum-Gum...

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:09.320
...Giant Balloon!

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:10.990
The scaffold is collapsing!

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:13.640
Blow them away along with the scaffold!

00:05:22.150 --> 00:05:25.000
There's a tunnel of fire in the smoke!

00:05:25.530 --> 00:05:28.300
You've always been like this! Luffy!

00:05:29.070 --> 00:05:34.220
You've never even listened to me
and always done such crazy things!

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:36.770
Ace!!

00:05:37.160 --> 00:05:40.520
--You did it, Straw Hat!
--That guy is really something else!

00:05:40.840 --> 00:05:43.570
--Can you fight, Luffy?
--Of course!

00:05:45.490 --> 00:05:48.700
He's my brother! Leave him alone!

00:05:49.450 --> 00:05:50.750
Fire Fist!

00:05:56.810 --> 00:05:59.620
Let's hurry, Luffy!
We gotta get out of this place!

00:05:59.810 --> 00:06:00.440
Alright!

00:06:00.520 --> 00:06:01.810
Don't be afraid!

00:06:01.940 --> 00:06:02.980
Gum-Gum...

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:04.110
Firefly!

00:06:04.190 --> 00:06:05.750
...Jet Gatling!

00:06:05.750 --> 00:06:07.320
Fiery Doll!

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:12.730
You got stronger, Luffy!

00:06:12.730 --> 00:06:14.760
I'll become stronger than you someday!

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:16.560
Pheasant Beak!

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:19.320
Flame Mirror!

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:24.230
Aokiji-san's ice...

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:28.800
Listen carefully, Whitebeard Pirates!

00:06:28.800 --> 00:06:33.700
I'm gonna give you an order
from the Captain one last time!

00:06:33.700 --> 00:06:39.370
Everyone, survive at any cost
and go back to the New World safely!

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:41.500
--Good old man!
--Pops!

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:46.590
I'm the only one that
you ought to worry about!

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:54.530
Straw boy!
Why are you standing around?!

00:06:54.780 --> 00:06:57.260
Let's go!
The old man has made up his mind...

00:06:57.410 --> 00:06:59.930
I know! And it won't be in vain!

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:04.130
As soon as you rescue
"Fire Fist" Ace, you run!

00:07:04.550 --> 00:07:07.280
The Whitebeards must be a group of cowards!

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:11.530
Well you can't help it, can you?

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:16.350
Because after all, Whitebeard is just
a loser from the old times!

00:07:16.800 --> 00:07:17.990
A loser?

00:07:19.010 --> 00:07:21.900
Take back what you just said!

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:25.830
Whitebeard is a great pirate
who shaped this era!

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:28.460
The name of this era should be "Whitebeard"!

00:07:34.410 --> 00:07:35.970
Ace has been burned!

00:07:36.670 --> 00:07:37.990
Ace...

00:07:39.540 --> 00:07:41.640
Ace's Vivre Card...

00:07:43.620 --> 00:07:45.460
Hey! Wait!

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:48.110
Luffy!

00:07:58.720 --> 00:07:59.370
What...

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:04.870
Ace...

00:08:06.850 --> 00:08:08.000
Ace-san!

00:08:08.270 --> 00:08:09.290
Ace...!

00:08:09.770 --> 00:08:12.050
He's been beaten!

00:08:16.320 --> 00:08:19.150
I'm sorry, Luffy...

00:08:21.790 --> 00:08:22.790
Huh?

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:25.900
I couldn't make it all the way.

00:08:26.620 --> 00:08:28.480
I'm sorry.

00:08:28.790 --> 00:08:31.610
Wh-What are you saying?
Don't be ridiculous!

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:35.240
Somebody, treat him! Please help Ace!

00:08:35.300 --> 00:08:36.800
It's no use.

00:08:37.510 --> 00:08:41.310
I can tell that my life is ending.

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:48.690
I can't hold out any longer.
So... l-listen to me, Luffy...

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:51.520
Wh-What did you say?

00:08:51.520 --> 00:08:54.460
You promised me that you'd never die...

00:08:54.460 --> 00:08:56.460
no matter what!

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:57.950
Ace!

00:08:58.110 --> 00:08:59.620
Yeah...

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:03.680
If it weren't for the late Sabo...

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:08.210
...and a high-maintenance brother like you,

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:13.150
I wouldn't even have a will to live.

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:20.560
Oh yeah. If you see Dadan someday,
say hello for me.

00:09:21.380 --> 00:09:25.620
When I face my own death,
I even miss a woman like her.

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:28.730
What? L-Like I said,
don't say that you're gonna die...

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:31.640
There is one thing that makes me wanna stay.

00:09:33.140 --> 00:09:38.480
That is my desire to see
you fulfill your dream.

00:09:40.450 --> 00:09:46.640
B-But I'm sure that you can do it!
Because you're my brother!

00:09:48.000 --> 00:09:49.380
Luffy.

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:55.360
Could you tell them
what I'm about to say now?

00:09:58.170 --> 00:09:59.350
Pops!

00:10:00.590 --> 00:10:01.720
Everybody!

00:10:02.800 --> 00:10:05.530
And you, Luffy.

00:10:06.380 --> 00:10:10.650
Thank you... for loving someone like me
who is good for nothing...

00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:15.220
...and who has such bad blood in his veins...

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:19.910
...up to today.

00:10:22.160 --> 00:10:23.760
Thank you!

00:10:54.960 --> 00:10:56.020
I promise.

00:10:56.770 --> 00:10:59.090
I'll never die!

00:11:08.090 --> 00:11:11.690
I now belong to the Revolutionary Army.

00:11:12.500 --> 00:11:17.900
My colleague, Ivankov, told me
what happened in Marineford in detail.

00:11:19.010 --> 00:11:23.730
I guess both you and Luffy are mad at me.

00:11:27.390 --> 00:11:29.470
I couldn't go save you...

00:11:30.480 --> 00:11:32.090
I'm sorry!

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:37.240
I wish... I wish I could've seen you again
while you were alive!

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:46.470
I'm gonna inherit... your will!

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:55.840
Luffy is our young brother!

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:13.100
This is the story of
the three brothers, Ace, Luffy, and Sabo.

00:12:13.100 --> 00:12:16.140
Their reunion and bond.

00:12:19.980 --> 00:12:27.410
EPISODE OF SABO
THE THREE BROTHERS' BOND -
THE MIRACULOUS REUNION AND THE INHERITED WILL

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:32.140
The beautiful flowers are
brightly decorating...

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:33.980
...this kingdom of love and passion

00:12:34.560 --> 00:12:41.150
where animated toys are
living side-by-side with humans quite naturally.

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:43.140
It's Dressrosa.

00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:48.720
DRESSROSA - AN URBAN AREA

00:12:49.090 --> 00:12:52.200
Here's your order! Dress Shrimp Paella!

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:57.640
Oh, oops. Excuse me.
That usually doesn't happen to me.

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:02.590
Whoa! Looks yummy!

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:06.120
In order to track down the
source of smuggled weapons

00:13:06.120 --> 00:13:09.450
spreading all over the world
from this country and stop it,

00:13:09.450 --> 00:13:12.320
Sabo is meeting up with his colleague of
the Revolutionary Army,

00:13:12.320 --> 00:13:13.880
who has infiltrated here before him.

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:16.620
Hey, are you listening?

00:13:16.620 --> 00:13:19.420
Yeah, Koala. So what's the situation?

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:22.230
First of all, you're paying
for your meal yourself.

00:13:22.770 --> 00:13:26.160
You know the king of Dressrosa
changed to Doflamingo

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:29.320
from King Riku a decade ago, don't you?

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:36.060
The official story is King Riku
suddenly became a tyrant one day

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:39.220
and Doflamingo took him down and
saved the country.

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:43.570
But during King Riku's era,
there were no rumors about smuggling weapons.

00:13:45.660 --> 00:13:49.760
That means there's a great chance that
Doflamingo is doing something secretly.

00:13:51.130 --> 00:13:53.890
Here is your Rose Squid Ink Pasta!

00:13:57.040 --> 00:13:59.130
Excuse me again.

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:01.190
You're doing it on purpose, aren't you?!

00:14:02.340 --> 00:14:07.470
All three of the Doflamingo Family's
top executives are Devil Fruit eaters.

00:14:09.980 --> 00:14:12.000
Diamante ate the Ripple-Ripple Fruit.

00:14:12.630 --> 00:14:14.440
Pica ate the Stone-Stone Fruit.

00:14:15.140 --> 00:14:17.120
Trebol ate the Stick-Stick Fruit.

00:14:18.120 --> 00:14:20.180
And they have a bunch
of other tough fighters.

00:14:21.140 --> 00:14:24.560
The most troublesome one among them
is a girl called Sugar.

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:27.090
We don't have any visual confirmation on her

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:29.250
but we know that she can
turn humans into toys -

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:30.990
she's a Hobby-Hobby Fruit eater.

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:35.350
Turn them into toys?!

00:14:35.740 --> 00:14:38.050
That means the toys here are...

00:14:41.250 --> 00:14:43.040
H-Humanitis!

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:48.180
Please try to remember!
It's me! Your dad!

00:14:48.180 --> 00:14:50.530
No! He's hurting me!

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:53.980
Get away from my child! Somebody! Help!

00:14:54.820 --> 00:14:59.700
Antonio! Maria! It's me! Try to remember!

00:15:00.040 --> 00:15:02.500
I'm a human!!

00:15:09.820 --> 00:15:11.620
People who have turned into toys

00:15:11.620 --> 00:15:14.890
are slipping out of other
people's memories, it seems.

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:17.810
Behind this joyful sight,

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:20.840
there is an abysmal darkness, it seems.

00:15:23.710 --> 00:15:26.060
Doflamingo must be behind this, too.

00:15:26.760 --> 00:15:29.780
Here is your Fairy Pumpkin Gazpacho!

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:38.770
Oh yeah. King Riku's second daughter is
a member of the Family, too.

00:15:38.770 --> 00:15:41.060
King Riku's daughter? Why?

00:15:41.840 --> 00:15:45.210
I don't know why but her name is Violet.

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:49.620
She can see through anything
with her ability, Clairvoyance.

00:15:50.410 --> 00:15:53.370
Clairvoyance?
That sounds troubling, too.

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:57.030
Luckily, it hasn't bothered
our undercover operation so far.

00:15:58.090 --> 00:16:01.430
King Riku also has a
granddaughter named Rebecca

00:16:01.430 --> 00:16:03.920
who is a gladiator at the Colosseum.

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:07.860
The king's granddaughter is a gladiator, huh?

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:10.980
And do you have any idea where
they produce the weapons?

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:16.460
Well... I haven't pinpointed where it is yet.

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:19.510
I saw some ships believed
to be trading ships arrive

00:16:19.510 --> 00:16:22.400
in the harbor several times
in the middle of the night

00:16:22.400 --> 00:16:24.830
but they were gone in the morning.

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:28.600
I assume there is a port
somewhere inside of the island.

00:16:29.820 --> 00:16:31.340
An underground port, huh?

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:33.300
I think so.

00:16:33.710 --> 00:16:36.890
Some locations I haven't checked through
because of tight security,

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:37.970
are the palace and...

00:16:38.440 --> 00:16:39.560
...the Colosseum.

00:16:40.250 --> 00:16:41.430
The Colosseum?

00:16:43.370 --> 00:16:44.830
This is fishy.

00:16:44.830 --> 00:16:46.690
Let's check there right away, like tonight.

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:54.110
I knew you were gonna say that.
Hack has already gone undercover there.

00:16:56.260 --> 00:16:59.620
He said he'll enter a fighting competition
sponsored by Doflamingo.

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:02.420
I bet he's warming up right now.

00:17:02.850 --> 00:17:06.440
Ring, ring, ring... Ring, ring, ring...

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:08.080
Ring, ring, ring... Clank.

00:17:08.560 --> 00:17:11.210
Speak of the devil, it's Hack.

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:13.080
Hey, this is major!

00:17:13.080 --> 00:17:15.880
I found out the prize for
the fighting competition!

00:17:16.180 --> 00:17:17.520
The prize?

00:17:18.080 --> 00:17:22.720
Considering that you took the trouble to call,
is it like a billion berries?

00:17:23.090 --> 00:17:24.470
Is that Sabo?

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:27.890
--When did you get here?
--Early this morning.

00:17:27.890 --> 00:17:30.940
You're just in time!
It's so much better than a billion!

00:17:31.300 --> 00:17:33.900
Listen carefully. The prize is...

00:17:41.550 --> 00:17:44.330
Incidentally, several hours later...

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:46.830
Wow! It's a rocky island!

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:51.250
We made it! It's Dressrosa!

00:17:52.770 --> 00:17:57.030
Luffy and the Straw Hats
along with Kin'emon from the Wano Kingdom,

00:17:57.030 --> 00:18:01.640
their pirate ally, Trafalgar Law, and the others,
arrived in Dressrosa.

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:10.080
GREENBIT                  DRESSROSA
GUARDING THE SHIP

00:18:02.570 --> 00:18:05.560
As they arrived the island,
they split into three teams.

00:18:06.090 --> 00:18:10.470
To hand over Doflamingo's associate, Caesar,

00:18:10.470 --> 00:18:14.390
they called Doflamingo to Greenbit,
the small island in the north,

00:18:14.920 --> 00:18:17.860
and in the meantime, they were going to

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:21.770
destroy the factory of SMILEs,
Doflamingo's precious man-made Devil Fruits,

00:18:21.770 --> 00:18:23.390
to weaken his influence, but...

00:18:28.030 --> 00:18:31.680
What you will see today
is one hell of an event!

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:38.530
The king entrusted us
with an extraordinary prize for today's event!

00:18:38.530 --> 00:18:44.800
Now, let's call in! The king of our country!
Doflamingo-sama!

00:18:47.090 --> 00:18:49.710
Doflamingo-sama!

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:55.250
Everyone! As you know,

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:58.560
a Devil Fruit will be
reproduced somewhere in the

00:18:58.560 --> 00:19:01.070
world when its eater dies.

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:08.100
For two years since that man lost his life
in the War of the Best at Marineford,

00:19:08.510 --> 00:19:14.210
we were looking for this Fruit and
we finally got hold of it!

00:19:14.990 --> 00:19:18.630
He was a 2nd division commander
of the Whitebeard Pirates

00:19:18.630 --> 00:19:20.680
and a son of the King of the Pirates,

00:19:20.680 --> 00:19:22.470
"Fire-Fist" Ace!

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:29.720
The ability that everybody
wants was reproduced in the

00:19:29.720 --> 00:19:32.590
form of a Devil Fruit in this world.

00:19:32.590 --> 00:19:36.480
The winner will get this forbidden fruit!

00:19:36.480 --> 00:19:42.280
It's a Logia, the most powerful type of Devil Fruit!
The Flare-Flare Fruit!

00:19:47.850 --> 00:19:51.430
THE COLOSSEUM - A DRESSING
ROOM FOR THE COMPETITORS

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:50.850
The Flare-Flare Fruit is mine!

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:52.460
Idiot! It's mine!

00:19:52.460 --> 00:19:55.290
I'll become a great pirate with
the Flare-Flare Fruit!

00:19:56.650 --> 00:20:01.260
But I can't just give it to you easily.

00:20:02.490 --> 00:20:08.650
Mr. Diamante, the hero of the Colosseum,
will fight in the final!

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:13.430
I am the hero of the Colosseum
and I will fight!

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:16.920
Diamante! Diamante!

00:20:17.280 --> 00:20:19.190
Diamante-sama!

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:23.150
What a bunch of idiots...

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:26.940
I'm pretty sure that Straw Hat will show up.

00:20:27.310 --> 00:20:28.660
I'll be counting on you.

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:34.460
Humph! A weakling like Straw
Hat is not a problem for me!

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:36.630
Their opponent, Doflamingo

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:39.390
was working out a scheme
to catch Luffy and the others

00:20:39.390 --> 00:20:41.130
in one fell swoop.

00:20:41.900 --> 00:20:46.170
Damn Doflamingo...
How dare he make a toy of Ace's Fruit!

00:20:47.450 --> 00:20:51.140
--I thought you'd come.
--I'm here for the search.

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:52.330
Don't fool yourself.

00:20:52.850 --> 00:20:55.980
I'll do my job. Otherwise, Koala'll get mad.

00:20:58.630 --> 00:21:01.270
Now I remember. Ace was your...

00:21:01.770 --> 00:21:04.300
I want it! The Flare-Flare Fruit!

00:21:04.840 --> 00:21:08.640
I don't want some stranger
to possess Ace's power.

00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:10.490
I won't let anybody have it!

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:13.100
Hmm... It's like a memento
of him to you, isn't it?

00:21:13.100 --> 00:21:15.720
It's possible that it's a trap considering

00:21:15.720 --> 00:21:18.330
the way Doflamingo dangled
it in front of you.

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:20.130
But one thing is for sure!

00:21:20.690 --> 00:21:24.520
You shouldn't let the chance slip by!
You don't wanna regret it afterward.

00:21:24.520 --> 00:21:26.010
Let's just go there!

00:21:26.150 --> 00:21:27.110
Uh-huh!

00:21:27.780 --> 00:21:31.570
Therefore, Luffy left the factory
destroying to Franky and the others

00:21:31.570 --> 00:21:33.970
and decided to enter the event.

00:21:34.040 --> 00:21:36.660
It's a huge Colosseum!

00:21:36.990 --> 00:21:41.630
Listen, Luffy. You can do as you like
but don't let them know who you are.

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:42.900
Got it!

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:44.610
Oh!

00:21:44.920 --> 00:21:46.270
Elderly people!

00:21:46.270 --> 00:21:48.350
Do you want me to carry
your bag or something?

00:21:49.590 --> 00:21:51.530
What a funny toy soldier!

00:21:51.530 --> 00:21:53.990
Oh? Am I funny?

00:21:54.300 --> 00:21:56.390
What about this? Or this?

00:21:57.120 --> 00:21:59.250
Hey buddy, get out of our way.

00:21:59.970 --> 00:22:03.600
Oh, I was in your way. I'm sorry!

00:22:09.470 --> 00:22:11.760
This is the dressing room
for the competitors.

00:22:13.170 --> 00:22:17.150
It's filled with excitement!
A variety of people are here!

00:22:24.770 --> 00:22:26.760
He's in the wrong place.

00:22:26.760 --> 00:22:28.150
Probably just looking for fun.

00:22:32.040 --> 00:22:33.220
All right!

00:22:37.740 --> 00:22:40.140
A statue of an old warrior man!

00:22:40.610 --> 00:22:42.220
Are you interested in that guy?

00:22:42.650 --> 00:22:43.330
Who are you?

00:22:44.160 --> 00:22:46.860
I'm Rebecca. A gladiator.

00:22:47.610 --> 00:22:52.530
This man was a legend.
He was the strongest gladiator, Kyros.

00:22:53.120 --> 00:22:55.950
He won 3000 out of 3000 matches.
An undefeated man.

00:22:55.950 --> 00:22:58.220
Wow! He was that strong?!

00:22:58.770 --> 00:23:02.820
But no one in this country knows about him.

00:23:02.820 --> 00:23:03.960
Huh?

00:23:04.640 --> 00:23:09.710
It's so mysterious
but I like this statue! It's so manly!

00:23:10.050 --> 00:23:12.900
--What block are you in?
--C.

00:23:12.900 --> 00:23:15.440
Great. I'm in D.

00:23:17.160 --> 00:23:20.160
I hope we both survive, Lucy.

00:23:26.570 --> 00:23:28.840
Happy Store!

00:23:29.490 --> 00:23:36.620
FIRST ROUND - BLOCK A

00:23:29.940 --> 00:23:32.700
The first round in which over 550 contenders

00:23:32.700 --> 00:23:34.790
in total were divided into four blocks,

00:23:34.790 --> 00:23:36.600
went on and...

00:23:37.990 --> 00:23:43.920
Wow! Oh my, oh my...
The winner of Block A is...

00:23:43.920 --> 00:23:49.050
...the captain of the first ship of
the fearful Emperor Blackbeard's group -

00:23:49.050 --> 00:23:51.760
Jesus Burgess!

00:23:55.120 --> 00:23:56.990
Oh, that guy's in this thing, too...

00:23:57.140 --> 00:24:00.580
All competitors of Block
B, please go to the ring!

00:24:03.480 --> 00:24:08.370
Leave the Flare-Flare Fruit in my hands.
You do the research of the Colosseum.

00:24:08.370 --> 00:24:09.550
Good luck.

00:24:09.690 --> 00:24:14.480
Alright, we're moving onto Block B!
A battle of 138 contenders!

00:24:14.480 --> 00:24:19.560
Only one person can proceed to the final!
Now, the battle...

00:24:19.560 --> 00:24:21.270
...begins!

00:24:31.760 --> 00:24:33.990
Four Thousand Brick Fist!

00:24:37.930 --> 00:24:39.490
Who the hell are you?!

00:24:40.600 --> 00:24:43.500
--You can't come in any farther!
--Where's the bathroom?!

00:24:44.030 --> 00:24:45.960
It's not this way! It's on the other side!

00:24:45.960 --> 00:24:47.470
I-I can't hold it!

00:24:56.410 --> 00:24:58.330
A dead end again.

00:25:04.600 --> 00:25:06.640
Where's the entrance to the basement?

00:25:10.290 --> 00:25:12.530
It feels so good!

00:25:14.220 --> 00:25:18.250
Some of us are taking this
thing seriously, brat!

00:25:18.830 --> 00:25:21.530
You'll have to excuse me
for attacking you from behind!

00:25:21.800 --> 00:25:24.660
Hey, wait! I'm not even ready to fight back!

00:25:24.810 --> 00:25:26.920
Four Thousand Brick Fist!

00:25:29.770 --> 00:25:31.590
Just kidding!

00:25:35.450 --> 00:25:38.470
Sabo! I'm sorry...

00:25:40.160 --> 00:25:45.390
Oh! A champion hopeful,
the Fish-Man Hack collapsed!

00:25:49.290 --> 00:25:51.230
I'm all set now.

00:25:53.340 --> 00:25:56.620
King...

00:25:57.260 --> 00:25:58.910
Wh-What the...

00:25:59.650 --> 00:26:01.730
...Punch!

00:26:23.870 --> 00:26:27.760
H-How powerful was that?!

00:26:27.760 --> 00:26:31.100
B-Block B - the winner is...

00:26:32.570 --> 00:26:35.440
Hey, look! Somebody's there!

00:26:36.950 --> 00:26:38.780
Barrier!

00:26:39.010 --> 00:26:41.950
I'm a barrier human
who ate the Barrier-Barrier Fruit!

00:26:42.760 --> 00:26:44.740
Barrier Crush!

00:26:54.440 --> 00:27:00.880
What the...! The winner of Block B is...
it's hard to believe but, Bartolomeo!

00:27:01.570 --> 00:27:04.330
The winner of Block A is Jesus Burgess,

00:27:04.330 --> 00:27:07.520
and the winner of Block B is Bartolomeo.

00:27:09.120 --> 00:27:11.140
Hey, hustle up!

00:27:12.370 --> 00:27:16.070
The next battle will start soon!
Hurry up and fix the ring!

00:27:19.340 --> 00:27:22.790
What are you doing?!
Do you wanna get scrapped?!

00:27:22.800 --> 00:27:24.320
Please wait!

00:27:24.320 --> 00:27:28.490
If you oil my joints, I still can work!

00:27:28.850 --> 00:27:29.750
Idiot!

00:27:30.000 --> 00:27:31.710
Don't be such a baby!

00:27:40.150 --> 00:27:42.510
Bear with it a little bit more!

00:27:42.510 --> 00:27:45.230
I'll expose the darkness behind
this country at any cost!

00:27:45.830 --> 00:27:50.810
Alright! Who is going to inherit
Ace's Fire Fist, the Flare-Flare Fruit?!

00:27:51.890 --> 00:27:53.810
I'll do it, Ace!

00:27:54.450 --> 00:27:59.280
Finally, the battle of Block C that Luffy is in,
was about to start.

00:28:05.220 --> 00:28:07.120
Now, the competitors enter!

00:28:08.850 --> 00:28:11.140
Oh! Today's likely winners
are coming in already!

00:28:11.140 --> 00:28:14.960
The Hasshoken users are entering first!

00:28:17.080 --> 00:28:20.720
He's the 13th leader of
the Happosui Army of Kano!

00:28:20.720 --> 00:28:21.750
Sai!

00:28:28.870 --> 00:28:32.440
Followed by the vice leader, Boo!

00:28:41.760 --> 00:28:44.890
And he was once ill-famed around
the world along with Roger,

00:28:44.890 --> 00:28:46.680
Whitebeard, and the others!

00:28:46.680 --> 00:28:50.990
The former leader with a 500 million bounty!
Don Chin Jao!

00:29:01.820 --> 00:29:04.850
Well, well, this guy is pretty tough, too!

00:29:04.850 --> 00:29:06.830
You're finished once you got targeted by him!

00:29:06.830 --> 00:29:09.930
A bounty hunter - Jean the Bandit!

00:29:19.130 --> 00:29:20.720
There are still more!

00:29:20.720 --> 00:29:23.650
Even the pirates with over a 100
million bounty are nothing to them!

00:29:24.840 --> 00:29:30.060
They're brutal assassin brothers!
The older brother is Kelly Funk and...

00:29:30.060 --> 00:29:32.990
...the younger brother, Bobby Funk!

00:29:42.940 --> 00:29:45.610
You must see his killer punch!

00:29:45.610 --> 00:29:50.390
A XXX rank boxer - "Destruction Cannon" Ideo!

00:29:56.620 --> 00:29:58.500
Here he comes!

00:29:58.500 --> 00:30:01.520
A warrior from Elbaph and the most
formidable "Pirate Mercenary"!

00:30:02.130 --> 00:30:05.280
A Giant - Hajrudin!!

00:30:15.100 --> 00:30:18.500
Don't forget about the
Colosseum's Grim Reaper!

00:30:20.350 --> 00:30:23.840
It shows no mercy! Brutal Bull!

00:30:30.660 --> 00:30:34.450
Now, all 139 competitors
of Block C are out there!

00:30:34.450 --> 00:30:39.480
Will one of these contenders
win the Flare-Flare Fruit?!

00:30:41.330 --> 00:30:42.590
Finally!

00:30:42.870 --> 00:30:46.640
Now, the battle...

00:30:46.640 --> 00:30:47.940
...begins!

00:30:50.310 --> 00:30:52.400
Let's do it!

00:30:52.400 --> 00:30:52.950
Whoa!

00:30:57.050 --> 00:30:59.880
I heard you're trying to kill Lucy.

00:31:00.480 --> 00:31:02.380
It's none of your business.

00:31:02.380 --> 00:31:06.250
No, that man is not yours to kill!

00:31:06.870 --> 00:31:10.190
I guess you recognize who he really is, too.

00:31:10.700 --> 00:31:13.270
But I'm the one who will kill him.

00:31:15.690 --> 00:31:18.150
My connection with him is much deeper.

00:31:19.020 --> 00:31:23.350
Because, ever since I saw him in Loguetown...

00:31:24.190 --> 00:31:27.230
I'm the man who'll be King of the Pirates!!

00:31:30.590 --> 00:31:35.290
That man is my icon!

00:31:37.390 --> 00:31:41.290
Meanwhile, the Caesar Handover
Team led by Law was...

00:31:38.270 --> 00:31:43.230
GREENBIT

00:31:41.290 --> 00:31:44.830
...at Greenbit next to Dressrosa and...

00:31:45.150 --> 00:31:48.580
That is the beach on the
southeast side of the island.

00:31:48.580 --> 00:31:50.880
We'll leave you there at
three in the afternoon.

00:31:50.950 --> 00:31:53.640
Look at the beach on the other side!

00:31:54.080 --> 00:31:57.100
--Isn't that a Navy ship?!
--What?

00:31:57.290 --> 00:32:01.020
It's not fair to hand me over here!
Abort this mission!

00:32:01.020 --> 00:32:07.110
The Navy is my enemy, too,
since I'm allied with the Straw Hats.

00:32:08.050 --> 00:32:10.940
We still have 15 minutes before they come.

00:32:11.470 --> 00:32:15.030
Everyone, cover me with
sniping and surveillance.

00:32:15.030 --> 00:32:16.990
Okay, I got it.

00:32:20.140 --> 00:32:21.080
Is this...

00:32:27.320 --> 00:32:28.550
Who are you people?

00:32:28.690 --> 00:32:30.340
What do you want?!

00:32:30.900 --> 00:32:31.880
You are...

00:32:33.590 --> 00:32:36.100
We are convict gladiators.

00:32:36.720 --> 00:32:41.360
We were sent here because we protested
against the Doflamingo Family.

00:32:42.360 --> 00:32:46.900
We'll keep fighting and get killed someday
in the ring, as part of the show.

00:32:48.020 --> 00:32:52.330
Before Doflamingo became king a decade ago,

00:32:52.330 --> 00:32:55.650
gladiatorial matches were not to the death.

00:32:55.650 --> 00:32:58.030
There is nowhere to run for us.

00:32:58.600 --> 00:33:00.720
They're all tough fighters

00:33:00.720 --> 00:33:04.290
but there is a giant warrior
who is literally sticking out!

00:33:10.310 --> 00:33:13.970
His name is Hajrudin!!

00:33:14.510 --> 00:33:20.540
With the Flare-Flare Fruit,
I'm gonna become the king of all Giants!

00:33:20.540 --> 00:33:23.100
Who can stop him?!

00:33:23.210 --> 00:33:24.390
On the other hand,

00:33:24.680 --> 00:33:28.460
there is a killer bull who
slayed 21 death row prisoners

00:33:28.460 --> 00:33:32.400
during a fight in this very Colosseum!

00:33:32.400 --> 00:33:36.450
People call him Brutal Bull!

00:33:36.790 --> 00:33:41.240
And somehow, someone knows how to tame
and ride this Grim Reaper!

00:33:42.720 --> 00:33:44.410
What is he doing?!

00:33:44.480 --> 00:33:46.430
Bursting into prominence,

00:33:46.430 --> 00:33:49.540
with his cool strength,
he instantly became a crowd favorite!

00:33:52.190 --> 00:33:53.500
Lucy!

00:33:55.450 --> 00:33:57.360
Lucy!

00:33:57.360 --> 00:34:00.140
I like that guy, too!

00:34:01.620 --> 00:34:03.330
What a funny guy.

00:34:07.180 --> 00:34:08.250
Clank.

00:34:10.640 --> 00:34:12.500
Hack lost, huh...

00:34:20.680 --> 00:34:24.330
Hey, Robin!
Can you walk a little more slowly?

00:34:24.390 --> 00:34:26.620
Who is it?! The Straw Hats?!

00:34:26.620 --> 00:34:28.370
No! They found us!

00:34:28.900 --> 00:34:30.710
Navy soldiers... What?!

00:34:30.860 --> 00:34:32.920
We got stripped of all we have!

00:34:34.610 --> 00:34:37.090
Mil Fleurs! Campo de Flores!

00:34:40.310 --> 00:34:43.560
--I caught one!
--Huh?! What did you catch?! Robin!

00:34:43.700 --> 00:34:44.850
I think it's a little person!

00:34:45.840 --> 00:34:47.230
Help me!

00:34:47.230 --> 00:34:49.010
Robin, what do you mean a little person?!

00:34:49.010 --> 00:34:51.150
Did you rob those Navy soldiers?

00:34:51.760 --> 00:34:52.980
Tranquilily!

00:34:54.000 --> 00:34:55.130
What?!

00:35:01.640 --> 00:35:02.950
Hajrudin!

00:35:02.950 --> 00:35:05.370
Is he the most likely to
win this competition?!

00:35:05.760 --> 00:35:08.910
I don't think so.
The one who will move onto the final is...

00:35:12.300 --> 00:35:16.380
The Hasshoken user,
Don Chin Jao of the Happosui Army.

00:35:16.380 --> 00:35:18.860
I can't believe a big fish like him is here.

00:35:19.680 --> 00:35:22.090
Can't wait to fight him in the final.

00:35:22.820 --> 00:35:25.220
I won't let him have the
Flare-Flare Fruit though.

00:35:27.250 --> 00:35:28.750
Go Moocy!

00:35:30.410 --> 00:35:32.480
Take them all down!

00:35:35.630 --> 00:35:36.480
Oh?

00:35:38.360 --> 00:35:40.650
What do you want?

00:35:43.090 --> 00:35:45.200
Do you wanna fight me?

00:35:45.430 --> 00:35:47.990
Oh, crap! Run, Moocy!

00:35:51.390 --> 00:35:52.600
Bull!

00:35:55.400 --> 00:35:59.420
What a disappointment!
It was obviously a mismatch!

00:36:04.660 --> 00:36:06.690
The Colosseum's Grim Reaper

00:36:06.690 --> 00:36:10.310
and the unknown gladiator -
Lucy couldn't do anything...

00:36:56.100 --> 00:36:58.660
The Giant's been knocked down!

00:36:58.940 --> 00:37:03.160
Hajrudin, undoubtedly one of
the champion hopefuls, lost his chance!

00:37:03.160 --> 00:37:06.280
It's an unbelievably major upset!

00:37:06.870 --> 00:37:09.180
Thank you for fighting together with me.

00:37:09.620 --> 00:37:12.040
Let me carry you to the
side of the ring, Moocy.

00:37:12.640 --> 00:37:14.410
That was awesome, Lucy!

00:37:15.100 --> 00:37:20.480
He came in and stirred things up in Block C!
Lucy did it again!

00:37:20.480 --> 00:37:24.380
I believe this guy still
has a lot more to show!

00:37:24.380 --> 00:37:30.050
Lucy! Lucy! Lucy! Lucy! Lucy!...

00:37:40.670 --> 00:37:41.720
That's...

00:37:57.040 --> 00:37:59.960
The Navy admiral... Fujitora!

00:38:05.190 --> 00:38:08.470
--Doflamingo!
--Joker!

00:38:11.600 --> 00:38:16.060
They're both targeting us.
I have to buy some time.

00:38:18.050 --> 00:38:21.810
Boo of the Happosui Army got defeated
by the Funk Brothers!

00:38:22.150 --> 00:38:26.420
Meanwhile, Jean the Bandit
took away Lucy's helmet!

00:38:26.700 --> 00:38:28.160
Hey, give it back!

00:38:29.240 --> 00:38:31.740
I heard this strange story, Lucy.

00:38:32.380 --> 00:38:35.480
I heard a pirate who's worth 400 million
named Straw Hat Luffy is...

00:38:35.480 --> 00:38:39.830
...secretly fighting in this competition
to win the Flare-Flare Fruit!

00:38:42.500 --> 00:38:43.840
I see...

00:38:44.750 --> 00:38:48.170
As I suspected, you are here, Luffy.

00:39:03.220 --> 00:39:05.530
Straw Hat Luffy!

00:39:07.380 --> 00:39:10.450
Garp's blood runs in your veins!

00:39:15.950 --> 00:39:18.910
Oh! Chin Jao starts charging!

00:39:18.910 --> 00:39:20.160
Garp!

00:39:20.440 --> 00:39:23.610
Block C! There are approximately
40 contenders remaining!

00:39:23.610 --> 00:39:26.000
It's narrowing down to the strongest!

00:39:27.690 --> 00:39:33.600
As Doffy plotted, you walked into a trap,
Straw Hat Luffy!

00:39:47.100 --> 00:39:48.150
No way...

00:39:49.840 --> 00:39:52.070
You've got to be kidding!

00:39:55.120 --> 00:39:56.420
Room!

00:40:10.640 --> 00:40:12.800
I-I can't believe it.

00:40:13.300 --> 00:40:16.260
Only those three spots that
they're standing have no damage!

00:40:16.510 --> 00:40:18.930
I just wanted to test your skills.

00:40:23.850 --> 00:40:27.150
My brother lost because
he trained himself poorly.

00:40:27.300 --> 00:40:28.900
Don't be so hard on him.

00:40:28.960 --> 00:40:31.190
Rah-Rah-Rah-Rampage!

00:40:34.200 --> 00:40:37.190
But, as the leader of the Happosui Army,

00:40:39.460 --> 00:40:42.560
I will avenge my subordinate!

00:40:44.400 --> 00:40:47.010
So strong! Hasshoken!

00:40:47.290 --> 00:40:49.840
Pay for it, Straw Hat Luffy!

00:40:50.200 --> 00:40:54.260
Your obnoxious grandpa took
all of my fortune away!

00:40:54.320 --> 00:40:55.610
Like I said before,

00:40:55.610 --> 00:40:57.930
I don't know what you're talking about!
Talk to my grandpa!

00:40:58.380 --> 00:41:03.480
It's too easy for Garp
if I punish him by death!

00:41:03.480 --> 00:41:06.560
I will make him feel how painful
it is to live with loss!

00:41:07.910 --> 00:41:10.820
Your grandpa is Garp? So you're really him!

00:41:11.050 --> 00:41:13.900
Anyway, you jerk! Give me back my helmet!

00:41:14.280 --> 00:41:16.780
Try to get it back! If you can get here!

00:41:17.220 --> 00:41:19.380
Take this! Charitable Donation!

00:41:20.290 --> 00:41:24.460
I made so much money in the
last two years thanks to you!

00:41:24.460 --> 00:41:27.920
I captured dozens of
prisoners who you set free

00:41:27.920 --> 00:41:30.750
from the great prison - Impel Down!

00:41:34.020 --> 00:41:35.840
Damn! Why can't I get him?!

00:41:36.110 --> 00:41:37.870
Oh?

00:41:44.820 --> 00:41:45.730
Give it back.

00:41:49.700 --> 00:41:53.010
You've been hurting me! You bastard!

00:41:57.540 --> 00:42:01.280
Out of the ring!
Jean the Bandit has been eliminated!

00:42:01.520 --> 00:42:05.410
The legendary pirate Don
Chin Jao head-butted him!

00:42:05.410 --> 00:42:07.250
He's still got it after all these years!

00:42:08.600 --> 00:42:10.750
Where did he go?

00:42:13.930 --> 00:42:15.550
Bullet String!

00:42:26.050 --> 00:42:28.570
I'm not gonna let you have it your way.

00:42:30.770 --> 00:42:34.320
Are you there, Straw Hat?!
Just give up!

00:42:34.320 --> 00:42:36.290
All right! Let's do it!

00:42:36.290 --> 00:42:38.990
I can't win the Flare-Flare Fruit
without beating him anyway!

00:42:39.450 --> 00:42:41.440
Now, Ideo and Sai,

00:42:41.440 --> 00:42:43.950
the two equally matched contenders,
are in a breathtaking fight!

00:42:45.370 --> 00:42:49.370
It's a life-and-death struggle!
Is Ideo gonna win?! Or Sai?!

00:42:50.810 --> 00:42:52.130
Outta my way!

00:42:52.230 --> 00:42:53.550
Move!

00:42:58.030 --> 00:42:59.820
What?!

00:43:30.940 --> 00:43:32.290
Conqueror's Haki...

00:43:32.290 --> 00:43:34.840
B-Block C!

00:43:36.710 --> 00:43:39.070
There are only two men left!

00:43:43.970 --> 00:43:46.310
Chin Jao has remained as I expected.

00:43:46.890 --> 00:43:48.850
Be careful, Luffy!

00:43:50.870 --> 00:43:53.670
I didn't know you could use Conqueror's Haki!

00:43:54.140 --> 00:43:56.770
What kind of king are
you dreaming to become?!

00:43:56.920 --> 00:43:58.690
The King of the Pirates!

00:44:00.400 --> 00:44:01.700
Shut up!

00:44:01.970 --> 00:44:04.320
You have to know that there are so many

00:44:04.320 --> 00:44:07.540
in the New World
who have the qualities of a king!

00:44:12.650 --> 00:44:15.340
Who taught you how to use the Haki?

00:44:15.420 --> 00:44:16.670
Rayleigh!

00:44:19.280 --> 00:44:21.220
Is he still alive?!

00:44:21.950 --> 00:44:23.180
How annoying!

00:44:27.950 --> 00:44:28.950
What?

00:44:28.950 --> 00:44:30.810
What?! Whaaat?!!

00:44:35.480 --> 00:44:37.270
Tell me, Straw Hat.

00:44:38.130 --> 00:44:40.650
I want to forget but it's always
right there in front of me!

00:44:41.690 --> 00:44:44.210
But it's out of my reach! My treasure!

00:44:45.630 --> 00:44:49.450
Can you imagine anything harder than that?!

00:44:52.830 --> 00:44:57.040
What's going on?!
The legendary pirate is crying!

00:45:00.440 --> 00:45:02.390
"Chin Jao the Drill."

00:45:02.390 --> 00:45:06.430
That's what they used to
call me but not anymore.

00:45:06.660 --> 00:45:10.380
Answer me! Do you know
what Garp has done to me?!

00:45:11.940 --> 00:45:14.350
I can't tell if you wanna cry or be mad!

00:45:17.050 --> 00:45:18.310
Watch out, Luffy!

00:46:24.570 --> 00:46:26.630
What a fight!

00:46:26.630 --> 00:46:31.370
It's too fast and I can't even
see what's going on anymore!

00:46:31.370 --> 00:46:33.610
I'm sure what we're seeing now is

00:46:33.610 --> 00:46:38.730
one of the greatest fights
ever in this Colosseum!

00:46:41.880 --> 00:46:43.520
You're quite a fighter.

00:46:45.800 --> 00:46:47.610
I can't get beaten by you here!

00:46:47.920 --> 00:46:49.070
But forget it!

00:46:50.180 --> 00:46:53.510
I'm like a wolf without its
fangs now and if you're only

00:46:53.510 --> 00:46:56.510
good enough to compete against
me in my present condition,

00:46:56.510 --> 00:46:58.120
you have no chance!

00:46:58.600 --> 00:47:00.580
Just give up being a pirate!

00:47:01.940 --> 00:47:04.650
If a guy like Rayleigh chose a brat

00:47:04.650 --> 00:47:09.230
of this level as the flag-bearer
for the new generation,

00:47:09.230 --> 00:47:11.460
he's not as smart as he used to be!

00:47:12.030 --> 00:47:13.910
The Navy showed some good insight when they

00:47:13.910 --> 00:47:15.590
squelched the most evil of the lot,

00:47:15.590 --> 00:47:18.180
I mean Ace, of course,
in the war two years ago.

00:47:18.180 --> 00:47:20.650
That fool had the demon's blood in his veins!

00:47:23.710 --> 00:47:24.690
What?

00:47:24.690 --> 00:47:28.000
You think you can beat the Navy admirals and

00:47:28.000 --> 00:47:30.910
the Four Emperors and surpass Roger?!

00:47:30.910 --> 00:47:32.530
That's hilarious!

00:47:32.680 --> 00:47:35.010
Gum-Gum...

00:47:37.330 --> 00:47:39.390
...Hawk Rifle!

00:47:52.240 --> 00:47:54.010
It's not over yet!

00:47:54.010 --> 00:47:55.720
Gum-Gum...

00:47:57.080 --> 00:47:59.210
...Rocket!

00:47:59.210 --> 00:48:02.300
Lucy is flying?!

00:48:03.080 --> 00:48:06.560
Come on! I'm gonna teach you a lesson!

00:48:06.560 --> 00:48:09.860
With 30 years' worth of my anger toward Garp,

00:48:09.860 --> 00:48:13.070
I'm gonna give you an all-out blow!

00:48:21.730 --> 00:48:24.900
Damn Garp! I won't forgive you!

00:48:24.900 --> 00:48:27.550
I'll carry this anger even towards
your children and grandchildren!

00:48:27.690 --> 00:48:29.050
What's that?!

00:48:29.050 --> 00:48:31.380
Am I just hallucinating or...

00:48:32.800 --> 00:48:36.260
Lucy's arm looks very big!

00:48:39.330 --> 00:48:42.170
Watch what I'm gonna do, Garp!

00:48:42.170 --> 00:48:45.650
I'm going to kill your precious grandson!

00:48:46.260 --> 00:48:50.380
I'm going to smash him
to the marrow of his bones!

00:48:50.370 --> 00:48:52.490
Hasshoken Technique!

00:48:53.090 --> 00:48:55.620
Gum-Gum...

00:48:55.930 --> 00:48:57.160
...Thor...

00:48:57.360 --> 00:48:58.830
Non-Drill Dragon...

00:48:58.840 --> 00:49:01.070
...Elephant Gun!

00:49:01.070 --> 00:49:03.340
...Non-Nail!

00:49:25.500 --> 00:49:28.310
Whaaat?!

00:49:44.630 --> 00:49:46.740
Oh, he went out of the ring!

00:49:46.740 --> 00:49:49.420
Chin Jao is eliminated by
being thrown out of the ring!

00:49:53.130 --> 00:49:55.410
Yeah!

00:49:56.390 --> 00:49:58.780
What a man!

00:49:58.780 --> 00:50:03.440
He beat the legend and
won the fierce battle for Block C!

00:50:03.890 --> 00:50:07.230
Lucy the Gladiator!

00:50:09.530 --> 00:50:12.030
--Lucy!
--Lucy!

00:50:12.030 --> 00:50:15.770
How much farther can he carry the momentum?!

00:50:15.770 --> 00:50:21.580
And who is going to win the championship
and the Flare-Flare Fruit?!

00:50:36.610 --> 00:50:39.280
The fighting competition
in the Corrida Colosseum!

00:50:39.280 --> 00:50:42.530
Now, these three contenders
have gotten the chance

00:50:42.530 --> 00:50:44.770
to challenge the Donquixote Family!

00:50:45.120 --> 00:50:48.900
However, due to the extensive
damage to the ring,

00:50:48.900 --> 00:50:53.220
the start of the battle for Block D
will be delayed by 15 minutes.

00:50:55.880 --> 00:50:57.970
Lucy the Gladiator, huh...

00:50:57.970 --> 00:50:59.610
Wait, Straw Hat!

00:50:59.610 --> 00:51:01.450
Oh, boy! They're so persistent!

00:51:02.680 --> 00:51:04.880
Fight me!

00:51:04.880 --> 00:51:09.120
Listen! Our old man wants
to say something to you!

00:51:09.120 --> 00:51:11.920
Boy... There's no place that
I can feel comfortable.

00:51:13.690 --> 00:51:17.840
Now you're a man of 400 million
so you have so many enemies.

00:51:23.200 --> 00:51:27.810
But I still can't believe that
crybaby became so strong...

00:51:30.500 --> 00:51:32.980
Can you, Ace?

00:51:45.250 --> 00:51:46.700
Hey, Sabo!

00:51:53.820 --> 00:51:55.820
Oh, Ace!

00:52:05.430 --> 00:52:07.430
Sorry I'm late!

00:52:10.230 --> 00:52:13.060
Whoa! You got a lot!
Way more than I did!

00:52:13.230 --> 00:52:15.330
That's a lot of money!
How'd you get that?

00:52:15.330 --> 00:52:17.330
I robbed some thugs.

00:52:17.330 --> 00:52:19.750
Damn! You won again!

00:52:19.750 --> 00:52:21.400
It doesn't matter if you win or lose.

00:52:21.930 --> 00:52:25.120
This is our "pirate savings"
that we'll use together someday.

00:52:25.640 --> 00:52:27.910
It's been five years since we started it.

00:52:27.910 --> 00:52:29.180
We worked hard.

00:52:29.410 --> 00:52:32.470
I wonder how much we need
to get a pirate ship.

00:52:32.470 --> 00:52:34.020
"A pirate ship"?!

00:52:37.610 --> 00:52:40.090
You guys!
Are you gonna become pirates?!

00:52:40.450 --> 00:52:42.760
I'm gonna become one, too!

00:52:45.230 --> 00:52:46.650
He found our secret.

00:52:47.180 --> 00:52:49.060
He's gonna tell somebody if nothing is done.

00:52:49.870 --> 00:52:51.890
--We gotta kill him.
--Alright, let's do it.

00:52:51.960 --> 00:52:53.440
What?!

00:52:53.440 --> 00:52:56.650
Help me!! I don't wanna die!!

00:52:56.840 --> 00:52:58.300
Shut up, you fool!

00:52:58.300 --> 00:53:00.820
I didn't expect that you'd kill me!

00:53:05.050 --> 00:53:06.200
Somebody's coming!

00:53:07.970 --> 00:53:13.500
Are you sure that it was a kid named Ace
who took the money from you guys?

00:53:14.190 --> 00:53:15.230
He's...

00:53:15.230 --> 00:53:19.130
I didn't know that those thugs
were working for Bluejam!

00:53:19.900 --> 00:53:22.210
I shouldn't have taken that money...

00:53:22.210 --> 00:53:24.210
That's Porchemy who works under Bluejam.

00:53:24.210 --> 00:53:26.700
Do you know that he strips off your scalp

00:53:26.700 --> 00:53:29.140
alive after you lose a fight with him!

00:53:29.670 --> 00:53:31.690
Let's just let them pass for now...

00:53:31.690 --> 00:53:32.360
Oh?

00:53:32.730 --> 00:53:33.770
Where is he?

00:53:35.210 --> 00:53:36.690
Let go of me! You bastard!

00:53:37.180 --> 00:53:39.610
How could he get caught?!

00:53:39.610 --> 00:53:41.860
Help me! Ace!!

00:53:42.760 --> 00:53:44.650
That fool! He's calling my name!

00:53:44.970 --> 00:53:47.320
Do you know Ace?

00:53:47.320 --> 00:53:48.370
I'm his friend!

00:53:49.640 --> 00:53:52.180
Oh, but he just tried to kill me.

00:53:52.180 --> 00:53:53.690
He's such a big mouth!

00:53:53.690 --> 00:53:55.370
Lay low, Ace!

00:53:55.520 --> 00:53:57.110
I don't know if you know about this

00:53:57.110 --> 00:54:01.430
but I heard that Ace stole some
money from us and ran today.

00:54:01.430 --> 00:54:03.260
You don't know where is it now, do you?

00:54:06.740 --> 00:54:08.680
I... I...

00:54:09.530 --> 00:54:10.800
I don't know...

00:54:10.800 --> 00:54:12.020
A terrible liar!

00:54:14.250 --> 00:54:17.270
Alright, alright! It can't be
helped that you don't know.

00:54:17.420 --> 00:54:19.920
Hey! What are you doing?! Hey!
Let go of me!

00:54:19.920 --> 00:54:21.690
Where are you taking me?! Dammit!

00:54:36.060 --> 00:54:37.250
This is good.

00:54:37.760 --> 00:54:39.100
Ace!

00:54:39.100 --> 00:54:42.630
Sabo! I moved all the treasure!

00:54:43.150 --> 00:54:44.400
How was it?

00:54:44.400 --> 00:54:47.130
Have they shown up around the
other tree to look for the money?

00:54:47.280 --> 00:54:51.250
No, they haven't. That kid...

00:54:51.640 --> 00:54:53.890
He hasn't told them anything!

00:54:54.000 --> 00:54:54.840
What?

00:54:55.680 --> 00:54:58.050
Spit it out already!

00:55:07.890 --> 00:55:09.350
Answer me!

00:55:10.040 --> 00:55:11.450
I won't say it.

00:55:12.890 --> 00:55:14.540
I won't say it!

00:55:15.410 --> 00:55:17.540
Tsk! You little shit!

00:55:26.610 --> 00:55:27.820
I won't say it...

00:55:28.740 --> 00:55:30.050
I won't say it!

00:55:35.200 --> 00:55:37.680
Fine. Enough.

00:55:41.040 --> 00:55:42.410
Then you die.

00:55:43.880 --> 00:55:45.730
Don't!

00:55:49.760 --> 00:55:52.700
It's him! He stole the money from us!

00:55:52.850 --> 00:55:54.370
Ace!

00:55:57.140 --> 00:55:58.120
Sabo!

00:55:58.420 --> 00:55:59.460
Ace!

00:55:59.740 --> 00:56:02.910
You made it easier for us
by coming here voluntarily!

00:56:07.130 --> 00:56:08.430
Porchemy-san!

00:56:08.860 --> 00:56:09.380
Oh?

00:56:11.580 --> 00:56:12.640
Let's go, Ace!

00:56:12.920 --> 00:56:15.470
--Go ahead!
--You fool! Hurry up!

00:56:15.760 --> 00:56:18.930
When I come to face someone,
I won't run!

00:56:20.000 --> 00:56:22.540
That's our money!

00:56:22.540 --> 00:56:25.150
We have better plans for that money!

00:56:25.150 --> 00:56:26.770
Stop talking crap!

00:56:27.060 --> 00:56:30.240
If I'm beaten by kids,
I may as well quit being a pirate!

00:56:33.600 --> 00:56:34.530
Ace!

00:56:34.680 --> 00:56:36.080
I'm gonna kill all of you!

00:56:48.740 --> 00:56:53.360
That was scary!
I thought I was gonna die!

00:56:53.870 --> 00:56:59.100
Shut up! Stop crying already!
I don't like cowards or people who cry a lot!

00:57:02.080 --> 00:57:08.360
Um... Thank you!
For... For helping me!

00:57:08.420 --> 00:57:11.720
--You...!
--Whoa-whoa, he's just being thankful.

00:57:11.720 --> 00:57:14.200
Why didn't you cough it up
in the first place?

00:57:14.690 --> 00:57:17.700
I thought if I said anything,
you wouldn't be my friend.

00:57:17.700 --> 00:57:20.300
It's better than dying, isn't it?

00:57:20.300 --> 00:57:23.120
Why do you wanna become my friend that much?

00:57:23.120 --> 00:57:26.170
Because I have nobody else to trust!

00:57:26.530 --> 00:57:29.500
Being lonely is more
painful than getting hurt!

00:57:34.910 --> 00:57:37.600
Is it easy for you when I'm around?

00:57:37.600 --> 00:57:38.430
Uh-huh.

00:57:39.470 --> 00:57:41.930
It's hard without me?

00:57:42.290 --> 00:57:43.180
Uh-huh!

00:57:44.830 --> 00:57:49.440
Do you want me to... live?

00:57:50.480 --> 00:57:51.800
Of course I do!

00:57:56.430 --> 00:57:57.480
I see.

00:58:00.350 --> 00:58:03.830
But I don't like spoiled kids like you.

00:58:03.830 --> 00:58:06.420
Have you ever gotten hit by a spiky thing?

00:58:06.420 --> 00:58:07.800
I'm only 7!

00:58:07.800 --> 00:58:11.490
When I become your age - 10,
I'll stop crying and become stronger!

00:58:11.490 --> 00:58:14.050
I wouldn't cry even if I were 7, stupid!

00:58:14.260 --> 00:58:16.900
I'm gonna become stronger than anyone!

00:58:16.900 --> 00:58:20.410
I promised Shanks that I'd
become a great pirate!

00:58:20.410 --> 00:58:22.620
--You? Become a pirate?
--Yes!

00:58:22.620 --> 00:58:24.060
--No way!
--Yes way!

00:58:25.430 --> 00:58:27.710
Hey, by the way,

00:58:27.710 --> 00:58:30.370
I have a little problem.

00:58:30.370 --> 00:58:37.030
The pirates will try to kill the three of us
after this for sure, right?

00:58:37.040 --> 00:58:41.400
The Trash Mountain that I've been
living at is close to their den.

00:58:41.660 --> 00:58:42.640
So...

00:58:44.770 --> 00:58:48.040
Ace! Luffy! Who is that?!

00:58:48.440 --> 00:58:51.420
How come there is one more kid?!

00:58:54.310 --> 00:58:57.290
Hey, you must be Dadan! I'm Sabo!

00:58:57.290 --> 00:58:58.530
Sabo?!

00:58:58.530 --> 00:59:00.500
I know your name!

00:59:00.500 --> 00:59:03.180
I've heard that you're a worthless brat, too!

00:59:03.180 --> 00:59:04.380
Oh yeah?

00:59:04.380 --> 00:59:07.600
I've heard that
you're a worthless old bag, too!

00:59:07.790 --> 00:59:11.250
That's unnecessary information!

00:59:19.320 --> 00:59:21.030
Gum-Gum...

00:59:21.100 --> 00:59:21.980
...Pistol...

00:59:22.700 --> 00:59:24.170
Gum-Gum...

00:59:24.790 --> 00:59:26.010
Gum-Gu...

00:59:26.430 --> 00:59:29.080
What are you trying to do?!

00:59:29.150 --> 00:59:30.420
One point!

00:59:31.660 --> 00:59:33.240
One more time!

00:59:33.240 --> 00:59:36.390
No! The rule is only 100 matches
per person a day.

00:59:36.390 --> 00:59:39.350
Luffy lost 50 times to me and Ace.

00:59:39.350 --> 00:59:44.500
Me vs. Ace is 24 - 26.
I lost by two.

00:59:44.500 --> 00:59:45.590
Dammit!

00:59:46.430 --> 00:59:47.850
You guys!

00:59:48.220 --> 00:59:51.550
When I become 10 years old,
I'll beat you two up!

00:59:51.550 --> 00:59:53.690
We'll be 13 then.

00:59:59.400 --> 01:00:01.940
You'll never catch up to us!

01:00:02.430 --> 01:00:03.970
Damn! It's not fair!

01:00:18.950 --> 01:00:22.180
Looks like it's not my place
to do anything about it.

01:00:22.860 --> 01:00:25.440
I'll leave the rest up to you, Luffy.

01:00:30.330 --> 01:00:33.560
While all of that was going on,
we have all the competitors in the ring!

01:00:33.560 --> 01:00:37.780
With one abstention,
there are 137 contenders for Block D!

01:00:43.220 --> 01:00:44.860
Okay, let's go for crocodiles!

01:00:45.180 --> 01:00:46.990
I love crocodile meat!

01:00:47.410 --> 01:00:50.250
You wait here.
You can't swim so you'd slow us dow...

01:00:50.250 --> 01:00:51.880
Crocodile meat!

01:00:51.880 --> 01:00:53.750
--I said "wait"!!
--He said "wait"!!

01:00:59.490 --> 01:01:02.160
GOA KINGDOM - DOWNTOWN

01:01:03.700 --> 01:01:06.600
I'm glad that they took the
skin for such a high price!

01:01:06.600 --> 01:01:08.390
We got more for the pirate savings!

01:01:12.370 --> 01:01:14.150
I'm hungry!

01:01:14.150 --> 01:01:16.360
--Let's eat something.
--Uh-huh.

01:01:17.250 --> 01:01:19.030
Three ramen noodles.

01:01:22.970 --> 01:01:24.570
This is ramen?!

01:01:25.180 --> 01:01:26.950
Yum-yum!

01:01:29.310 --> 01:01:31.230
Here are your...

01:01:31.230 --> 01:01:32.160
You kids!

01:01:33.440 --> 01:01:35.670
Those three naughty boys!

01:01:38.360 --> 01:01:41.590
It's those three again!
Why were they let in?!

01:01:41.930 --> 01:01:46.060
Don't let them run away!
Somebody, catch those three kids!

01:01:46.320 --> 01:01:47.140
Sabo?

01:01:47.140 --> 01:01:50.470
You're Sabo, aren't you?! You're alive!

01:01:50.470 --> 01:01:52.710
--Who is that?
--He confused me with someone else.

01:01:53.080 --> 01:01:53.890
H-Hey!

01:01:53.960 --> 01:01:55.270
Wait! Sabo!

01:01:55.420 --> 01:01:56.820
He's calling you!

01:01:56.820 --> 01:01:59.370
We can't have secrets among us!

01:02:03.630 --> 01:02:05.340
What?!

01:02:05.700 --> 01:02:07.200
The son of a noble?!

01:02:07.430 --> 01:02:12.020
The man who called to me today was my father.

01:02:12.470 --> 01:02:16.420
Why were you living here
if you are from a noble family?

01:02:16.810 --> 01:02:21.260
They love those who can maintain their
status and defend their property.

01:02:21.260 --> 01:02:22.630
Not me!

01:02:22.690 --> 01:02:27.510
I'm sorry for both of you but I was
all by myself even if I had parents!

01:02:27.740 --> 01:02:30.680
Stay away from the Gray Terminal.

01:02:30.680 --> 01:02:33.430
People who live there are scum!

01:02:33.750 --> 01:02:37.190
Nobles have a low opinion of
the Gray Terminal

01:02:37.580 --> 01:02:40.890
but it's better than the stifling Highland

01:02:40.890 --> 01:02:44.150
where your life has been arranged for years to come!

01:02:46.630 --> 01:02:51.280
Ace! Luffy!
We gotta set out to sea someday!

01:02:51.350 --> 01:02:54.160
Let's get out of this country
and live freely!

01:02:56.740 --> 01:02:59.390
You don't have to tell me to!

01:02:59.820 --> 01:03:04.260
I'm gonna become a pirate and
defeat all the others and

01:03:04.260 --> 01:03:06.300
become the most notorious
pirate in the world!

01:03:07.110 --> 01:03:09.460
It'll be the only proof of my life!

01:03:10.030 --> 01:03:16.100
It doesn't matter if all the people in the world
reject me or despise me,

01:03:16.520 --> 01:03:19.130
I'll become a great pirate
and show them what I can do!

01:03:21.130 --> 01:03:23.230
I got it! Alright then...!

01:03:23.760 --> 01:03:25.990
I'm gonna become...!

01:03:31.430 --> 01:03:35.100
You fool...
I was wondering what you'd have to say...

01:03:36.520 --> 01:03:39.020
You're funny, Luffy!

01:03:39.020 --> 01:03:42.150
I can't wait to see how you turn out
in the future!

01:03:44.420 --> 01:03:45.920
Did you guys know?!

01:03:46.490 --> 01:03:49.260
We can become brothers
if we exchange this cup of sake!

01:03:49.410 --> 01:03:51.680
Brothers? Really?!

01:03:57.110 --> 01:04:02.130
When we become pirates,
we might not be on the same ship

01:04:02.910 --> 01:04:06.340
but our brotherhood will always be with us!

01:04:06.760 --> 01:04:10.010
Wherever you are, whatever you do,
we'll always be bonded together!

01:04:10.930 --> 01:04:12.870
So from now on,

01:04:13.910 --> 01:04:15.050
we're brothers!

01:04:15.880 --> 01:04:17.270
Yeah!!

01:05:44.810 --> 01:05:45.880
Ace...

01:05:47.940 --> 01:05:48.960
Ace!

01:05:59.700 --> 01:06:02.640
V-V-V... Vice Captain!

01:06:03.160 --> 01:06:05.310
Huh?! What are you talking about?

01:06:05.460 --> 01:06:10.060
Y-Y-You're Zoro-senpai, aren't you?
Luffy-senpai's right-hand man?

01:06:10.510 --> 01:06:13.950
How do you know about Luffy and my name?!

01:06:14.090 --> 01:06:18.160
I'be albayz bween your ban!

01:06:18.220 --> 01:06:19.660
Stop crying!

01:06:19.660 --> 01:06:24.660
If I bring Luffy-senpai here,
can I have your autograph?

01:06:24.880 --> 01:06:27.330
You can do that for me?
I'll be counting on you!

01:06:27.330 --> 01:06:32.160
Wait for me there!
I'm gonna bring him at the risk of my life!

01:06:33.080 --> 01:06:34.880
"Pirate Hunter" Zoro!

01:06:36.950 --> 01:06:38.790
Pentachromatic Strings!

01:06:47.750 --> 01:06:52.650
Although I told him that,
where did Luffy-senpai go?

01:06:52.650 --> 01:06:58.210
I can't find him anywhere.
I can't face Zoro-senpai like this...

01:07:01.850 --> 01:07:05.750
L-L-L... Luffy-senpai!

01:07:10.310 --> 01:07:11.200
Scalpel!

01:07:15.600 --> 01:07:16.630
Bullet String!

01:07:22.140 --> 01:07:24.520
What are you gonna do now?

01:07:25.910 --> 01:07:28.650
Dressrosa is right there.

01:07:31.590 --> 01:07:33.860
Zoro! Kin'emon!

01:07:33.860 --> 01:07:37.050
Luffy! Don't shout, idiot!

01:07:37.050 --> 01:07:41.070
I'm glad to see you!
Crest Head showed me the way!

01:07:41.070 --> 01:07:42.490
Where is he?

01:07:42.640 --> 01:07:45.540
He collapsed on our way here.

01:07:45.540 --> 01:07:47.330
And what do you want?

01:07:47.610 --> 01:07:52.710
You fool! Why didn't you tell me
there was this kinda competition?!

01:07:52.860 --> 01:07:54.820
You're right. Sorry!

01:07:54.940 --> 01:07:56.510
Ring, ring, ring...

01:07:56.510 --> 01:07:59.220
--Is this how you use it?
--What are you doing?

01:07:59.530 --> 01:08:03.040
Sanji-dono told me to
call once we see Luffy-dono.

01:08:03.040 --> 01:08:04.200
Yeah?

01:08:04.200 --> 01:08:06.150
Oh yeah, Luffy.

01:08:06.150 --> 01:08:09.230
The Colosseum has been besieged by the Navy.

01:08:10.080 --> 01:08:12.770
You don't care?!
That was what we came here for!

01:08:13.000 --> 01:08:18.880
OFF THE COAST OF DRESSROSA

01:08:13.460 --> 01:08:15.390
Ring, ring, ring...

01:08:15.390 --> 01:08:17.090
Must be Kin'emon.

01:08:17.090 --> 01:08:19.530
Call Usopp with the other one, Chopper.

01:08:19.530 --> 01:08:21.410
--Okay!
--Clank.

01:08:21.810 --> 01:08:23.960
Sanji? It's me!

01:08:23.960 --> 01:08:25.140
Luffy!

01:08:25.140 --> 01:08:27.280
This is Usopp!

01:08:27.280 --> 01:08:29.620
Alright. Tell me your situation.

01:08:30.690 --> 01:08:34.500
This is Franky!
I'm with Usopp and Robin!

01:08:34.790 --> 01:08:41.060
We are currently with the King Riku Army,
an anti-Doflamingo coalition in this country.

01:08:41.060 --> 01:08:43.470
--An army?
--Of Little People.

01:08:44.600 --> 01:08:46.560
Luffy, do you remember

01:08:46.560 --> 01:08:49.270
we met the strange toy soldier
outside of the Colosseum?

01:08:49.670 --> 01:08:50.600
Uh-huh.

01:08:50.600 --> 01:08:54.390
He was actually the commander of this army.

01:08:54.990 --> 01:08:59.200
And all the people here are looking to
take down Doflamingo this very day.

01:08:59.590 --> 01:09:05.270
It seems like everybody's happy at first
but this country has a very dark side.

01:09:05.850 --> 01:09:10.160
If we can knock out Sugar,
the Hobby-Hobby Fruit eater,

01:09:10.160 --> 01:09:12.710
all the toys will change
back into their human forms!

01:09:13.050 --> 01:09:18.020
The toys have had their families,
loved ones, and friends taken away by Sugar!

01:09:18.510 --> 01:09:21.550
I'm sure they're angry at Doflamingo!

01:09:21.820 --> 01:09:24.410
If we can change them back
into their human forms,

01:09:24.410 --> 01:09:27.100
Doflamingo's establishment
will be shaken up big time!

01:09:27.600 --> 01:09:30.990
We'll let Sugar eat this
clump of Tatababasco Sauce,

01:09:30.990 --> 01:09:33.600
the hottest spice in the
world, and knock her out!

01:09:33.750 --> 01:09:39.030
Right! We'll bring down the Doflamingo Family
by carrying through this operation

01:09:39.030 --> 01:09:42.650
and take Dressrosa back for King Riku!

01:09:42.650 --> 01:09:44.280
Yeah!

01:09:44.340 --> 01:09:50.270
This brave, little army is going to
challenge their filthy, monstrous enemy!

01:09:50.930 --> 01:09:54.420
I can't let them down!

01:09:54.770 --> 01:09:58.960
Luffy! No matter what you say,
I'm gonna fight with them!

01:10:00.260 --> 01:10:01.420
Franky...

01:10:01.900 --> 01:10:05.130
You're free to go all out!
We'll be there as soon as possible!

01:10:06.370 --> 01:10:07.640
Thanks!

01:10:13.250 --> 01:10:16.810
--What's going on?! The town is...
--It's coming this way!

01:10:20.210 --> 01:10:21.510
What the...

01:10:25.760 --> 01:10:27.990
Tra-guy! Doflamingo!

01:10:31.980 --> 01:10:35.360
Hey, Tra-guy!
Why are you with Doflamingo...

01:10:35.930 --> 01:10:38.840
Stupid brat! You've pushed it too far!

01:10:50.330 --> 01:10:52.720
Tra-guy!!

01:10:55.140 --> 01:10:56.600
Mingo!!

01:10:57.020 --> 01:10:58.900
How dare you shoot Tra-guy!

01:10:59.180 --> 01:11:00.920
Straw Hat.

01:11:01.400 --> 01:11:04.980
It's none of your damn business.

01:11:04.980 --> 01:11:09.780
Law was originally my subordinate.
Responsibility for dealing with him falls to me!

01:11:10.510 --> 01:11:12.990
--Kin, retrieve Tra-guy!
--Okay!

01:11:22.460 --> 01:11:25.070
What's this heaviness?!

01:11:29.740 --> 01:11:31.140
Zoro-dono!

01:11:36.030 --> 01:11:38.990
Zoro! Kin'emon! I'm coming!

01:11:39.290 --> 01:11:44.030
Oh yeah... It's Sea Prism Stone...

01:11:56.350 --> 01:11:57.580
Admiral-dono!

01:12:01.860 --> 01:12:04.420
I can't believe he was a Navy admiral!

01:12:04.570 --> 01:12:05.550
An admiral?!

01:12:05.910 --> 01:12:09.840
Hello. Life is full of ironies.

01:12:11.010 --> 01:12:14.510
You need to come to the Palace with me, Law.

01:12:16.200 --> 01:12:17.250
Law-dono...

01:12:17.250 --> 01:12:18.090
Wait!

01:12:18.710 --> 01:12:20.230
Catch Roronoa Zoro!

01:12:26.630 --> 01:12:27.190
What?!

01:12:27.570 --> 01:12:29.720
How are they flying?!

01:12:32.630 --> 01:12:34.030
Let's run for now!

01:12:38.350 --> 01:12:39.760
Tra-guy!

01:12:40.730 --> 01:12:43.940
Hey, Luffy! Look for the exit now!

01:12:43.940 --> 01:12:46.470
We're gonna wait for you
by running around here!

01:12:46.470 --> 01:12:47.440
Okay!

01:12:48.180 --> 01:12:50.130
I'll take Tra-guy back at any cost!

01:12:50.460 --> 01:12:53.890
And beat the hell out of Doflamingo!

01:13:06.420 --> 01:13:08.820
Wait for me, Tra-guy! I'll be there!

01:13:10.050 --> 01:13:13.200
Damn! It's a dead end again!

01:13:13.200 --> 01:13:14.970
Where's the exit?!

01:13:17.770 --> 01:13:20.540
Oh! Crest Head! Glad to see you here!

01:13:22.080 --> 01:13:24.720
L-L-L-Luffy-senpai!

01:13:30.280 --> 01:13:36.010
L-Luffy-senpai, d-did you
get to see Z-Zoro-senpai?!

01:13:36.480 --> 01:13:38.770
Yes, I did! Thank you for that!

01:13:38.770 --> 01:13:40.680
My pleasure!

01:13:40.980 --> 01:13:44.630
Now I gotta go somewhere
so I need to get out!

01:13:45.420 --> 01:13:48.690
But Luffy-senpai,
what about the Flare-Flare Fruit?

01:13:51.420 --> 01:13:53.800
I wanna keep it out of
the hands of a few people

01:13:54.340 --> 01:13:57.280
but I don't have a choice!
My friend's gonna die!

01:13:57.570 --> 01:13:59.910
In that case, you can count on me!

01:14:00.100 --> 01:14:03.500
I was gonna bring the precious
keepsake from Ace-sama

01:14:03.500 --> 01:14:06.720
to you once I won it, from the beginning!

01:14:06.720 --> 01:14:08.260
What?! I can have it?!

01:14:08.260 --> 01:14:11.420
Of course!
So you can go out without worry!

01:14:11.490 --> 01:14:13.510
Thanks! I appreciate it!

01:14:14.490 --> 01:14:17.270
Luffy... Ace...

01:14:18.360 --> 01:14:22.230
I couldn't do anything at that time...

01:15:18.180 --> 01:15:19.870
The Flare-Flare Fruit...

01:15:21.680 --> 01:15:23.450
I won't let you have it.

01:15:23.890 --> 01:15:25.910
"Straw Hat Luffy"!

01:15:25.910 --> 01:15:30.840
Who the hell are you?!
You can't talk to Luffy-senpai so casually!

01:15:31.110 --> 01:15:36.030
He is the legendary pirate
"Fire Fist" Ace-sama's brother

01:15:36.030 --> 01:15:39.300
and he'll become the King of the Pirates one day,
you idiot!

01:15:39.730 --> 01:15:41.800
I've known that from way back.

01:15:53.170 --> 01:15:55.990
You've known that from way back?
Who are you?!

01:15:56.440 --> 01:15:57.900
Don't you recognize?

01:15:58.250 --> 01:16:02.550
I don't know you!
Come on! I'll kick your ass right here!

01:16:02.550 --> 01:16:04.290
Straw Hat Luffy.

01:16:05.990 --> 01:16:07.580
"Fire Fist" Ace.

01:16:08.090 --> 01:16:12.550
The Flare-Flare Fruit belongs to Ace!
I won't let you have it!

01:16:12.550 --> 01:16:16.340
I think you had another brother...

01:16:16.490 --> 01:16:17.300
What?

01:16:20.450 --> 01:16:21.610
He's...

01:16:22.290 --> 01:16:24.220
He's... already...

01:16:25.560 --> 01:16:27.790
He's... already...

01:16:32.960 --> 01:16:34.070
He's...

01:16:38.800 --> 01:16:41.450
Y-You are...!

01:16:53.060 --> 01:16:56.550
It's been a while! Luffy!

01:17:10.250 --> 01:17:13.440
You've finally made it out
so why are you crying?!

01:17:16.320 --> 01:17:19.520
Stop crying already!
Don't you wanna save Tra-guy?!

01:17:22.660 --> 01:17:26.450
I'll save Tra-guy!
And I'll kick Mingo's ass!

01:17:26.450 --> 01:17:29.040
Plus, the Flare-Flare Fruit is in good hands!

01:17:29.820 --> 01:17:33.420
I-I never imagined he'd be alive!

01:17:33.660 --> 01:17:34.670
Who are you talking about?!

01:17:36.090 --> 01:17:41.340
Th-That day... Dogura...
Dogura told us that... So...

01:17:42.260 --> 01:17:46.970
I-I thought he died at that moment!

01:17:47.290 --> 01:17:49.840
I heard Robin-san's here
in this country, too.

01:17:49.840 --> 01:17:51.940
I hope I can see her after such a long time.

01:17:52.490 --> 01:17:54.170
I'm glad that you got to see him.

01:17:54.170 --> 01:17:57.940
Yeah... I thought he was gonna punch me.

01:18:00.410 --> 01:18:01.500
Are you crying?

01:18:02.180 --> 01:18:04.070
I don't cry!

01:18:04.740 --> 01:18:07.280
If you were there, do you think
you could've changed something?

01:18:08.440 --> 01:18:10.270
Nobody knows.

01:18:10.550 --> 01:18:11.700
Yeah.

01:18:12.390 --> 01:18:15.310
Let me know when you find
out about the underground.

01:18:15.310 --> 01:18:16.450
Okay.

01:18:17.650 --> 01:18:21.460
In any case,
I will win Ace's Flare-Flare Fruit!

01:18:22.280 --> 01:18:26.160
We will inherit his will!

01:18:27.780 --> 01:18:31.390
Th-The fighting competition
in the Corrida Colosseum!

01:18:31.390 --> 01:18:33.770
The last winner moving to the final is...

01:18:38.090 --> 01:18:41.510
...unbelievably, a convict gladiator
and a granddaughter of King Riku,

01:18:41.510 --> 01:18:44.270
the blot in the history of Dressrosa!

01:18:44.270 --> 01:18:46.070
Rebecca!

01:18:46.140 --> 01:18:47.540
Screw you!

01:18:47.540 --> 01:18:49.870
--I know she cheated!
--You little tramp!

01:18:51.350 --> 01:18:54.730
THE LIFT TO THE ENTRANCE OF THE ROYAL PALACE

01:18:53.350 --> 01:18:54.710
How do we get into the palace?!

01:18:55.070 --> 01:18:57.580
--By kicking their asses!
--You're Straw Hat Luffy, aren't you?

01:18:57.650 --> 01:19:00.130
I've been waiting for you.
I'll help you enter to the palace!

01:19:00.440 --> 01:19:01.630
Who are you?

01:19:01.820 --> 01:19:06.450
VIOLET - A CLAIRVOYANCE USER

01:19:01.890 --> 01:19:03.550
I'm Violet. Now let's hurry!

01:19:03.550 --> 01:19:06.430
The King Riku Army has started to move, too!

01:19:06.950 --> 01:19:10.720
We'll sneak into enemy territory
through the underground passage!

01:19:10.790 --> 01:19:12.160
Yeah!

01:19:12.480 --> 01:19:14.800
The fighting competition
in the Corrida Colosseum!

01:19:14.800 --> 01:19:16.520
The final round starts soon!

01:19:16.900 --> 01:19:21.230
The special ring is set!
We can't help getting excited!

01:19:24.720 --> 01:19:25.900
I made it!

01:19:26.010 --> 01:19:29.070
Oh! Lucy! I'm moving on to...

01:19:30.220 --> 01:19:31.740
Huh? Lucy?

01:19:32.260 --> 01:19:35.750
You're Rebecca, aren't you?
I know your background.

01:19:36.780 --> 01:19:41.620
It's gonna get a little messy, maybe,
but I won't do you wrong.

01:19:43.130 --> 01:19:45.050
They're just putting up a good front.

01:19:45.860 --> 01:19:47.340
This country is like...

01:19:48.640 --> 01:19:51.230
...the country we grew up in, in some ways.

01:19:54.280 --> 01:19:55.310
Stop it!

01:19:59.830 --> 01:20:02.870
--Sabo...
--Give Sabo back!

01:20:02.870 --> 01:20:05.820
What, you little shit? Do you want more?!

01:20:06.090 --> 01:20:07.450
Stop it!

01:20:08.840 --> 01:20:10.180
Ace!

01:20:10.300 --> 01:20:11.710
I'm okay...

01:20:11.710 --> 01:20:13.740
Give him back, Bluejam!

01:20:14.120 --> 01:20:16.790
What do you mean "give him back"?

01:20:16.790 --> 01:20:18.270
Sabo is my son.

01:20:18.270 --> 01:20:21.460
How dare you two tempt Sabo to run away!

01:20:21.860 --> 01:20:25.710
Nobody tempted me!
I ran away of my own will!

01:20:25.860 --> 01:20:30.310
You stay out of this!
I'll leave the rest up to you, pirates.

01:20:30.310 --> 01:20:32.350
Of course, mister.

01:20:32.700 --> 01:20:37.230
We will take care of these two
so they won't bother your boy again.

01:20:38.750 --> 01:20:42.270
Wait a minute, Bluejam!
Dad, that's enough! I understand!

01:20:44.250 --> 01:20:46.530
What do you understand?

01:20:46.590 --> 01:20:47.650
Don't do it, Sabo!

01:20:47.650 --> 01:20:52.790
I'll live as you want
so please don't hurt these two!

01:20:54.930 --> 01:20:56.490
I'm begging you.

01:20:56.490 --> 01:20:58.260
They're very important to
me, they're my brothers!

01:20:58.260 --> 01:20:58.790
Sabo...

01:20:59.940 --> 01:21:01.210
Let's go home, Sabo.

01:21:04.070 --> 01:21:05.960
Hey! Don't go!

01:21:08.900 --> 01:21:11.550
Run! You don't have to worry about us!

01:21:14.740 --> 01:21:17.150
You said you wanna live freely with us!

01:21:24.210 --> 01:21:27.110
--Are you gonna put an end to your dream, Sabo?!
--Sabo!

01:21:27.170 --> 01:21:28.930
Sabo!!

01:21:33.140 --> 01:21:36.080
Oh, Sabo! You're back.

01:21:36.080 --> 01:21:37.650
You got bigger.

01:21:38.980 --> 01:21:42.000
Now Stelly, say "hi" to your older brother.

01:21:42.170 --> 01:21:46.840
Nice to meet you, Brother-sama!
My name is Stelly and I'm 8.

01:21:47.110 --> 01:21:48.260
Who is he?

01:21:48.260 --> 01:21:52.350
We adopted him.
Just in case you failed in life...

01:21:54.030 --> 01:21:56.270
Anyway, he's your smart younger brother.

01:21:57.580 --> 01:22:00.070
You have the devil's luck
because they're gonna

01:22:00.070 --> 01:22:02.230
take care of the burnables tomorrow night.

01:22:02.500 --> 01:22:05.720
If you had stayed in the Trash Mountain,
you would've died.

01:22:05.710 --> 01:22:06.560
What do you mean?

01:22:06.790 --> 01:22:09.580
They'll burn down the Gray Terminal.

01:22:09.580 --> 01:22:10.720
What?!

01:22:10.720 --> 01:22:13.070
They decided it months ago.

01:22:13.680 --> 01:22:15.730
A group of observers from
the World Government

01:22:15.730 --> 01:22:18.010
will arrive in Goa Kingdom three days later!

01:22:18.010 --> 01:22:23.160
And they'll have a World Noble - a
Celestial Dragon with them on the ship.

01:22:23.500 --> 01:22:26.450
So to gain his favor, the
members of the royal family

01:22:26.450 --> 01:22:29.710
decided to burn up all the
shameful parts of this country.

01:22:29.710 --> 01:22:32.890
There are a lot of people living there!

01:22:32.890 --> 01:22:33.770
They can't...

01:22:33.770 --> 01:22:36.510
I said they'll burn up all

01:22:37.740 --> 01:22:39.180
You mean, the people, too?

01:22:42.660 --> 01:22:44.170
H-Hey!

01:22:44.620 --> 01:22:46.980
I-It is not my fault.

01:22:50.880 --> 01:22:54.040
--Run!
--The fire is spreading all around!

01:22:54.040 --> 01:22:55.110
Help!

01:22:57.140 --> 01:23:01.540
--We can't run! The fire is everywhere!
--We have nowhere to go!

01:23:01.760 --> 01:23:04.960
Ace... Luffy... Run!

01:23:05.500 --> 01:23:08.420
--That brat is still there!
--Make him go away.

01:23:08.640 --> 01:23:12.210
Please! My brothers are out there!
Let me through!

01:23:12.280 --> 01:23:13.970
No matter how many times you come, we won't!

01:23:20.890 --> 01:23:23.560
This country will be cleaner after this.

01:23:32.960 --> 01:23:35.510
Ace... Luffy...

01:23:35.510 --> 01:23:37.490
What happened to you, boy?

01:23:41.080 --> 01:23:42.410
Old man...

01:23:44.180 --> 01:23:46.490
The royalty and nobles are...

01:23:48.400 --> 01:23:50.710
behind the fire...

01:23:51.940 --> 01:23:53.250
Believe me!

01:23:55.260 --> 01:23:59.550
This town smells worse
than the Gray Terminal.

01:24:00.370 --> 01:24:04.050
It smells like rotten people!

01:24:04.500 --> 01:24:09.400
If I stay here... I'll never be free!

01:24:12.000 --> 01:24:15.990
I'm ashamed of being born a noble!

01:24:16.670 --> 01:24:21.890
They finally made a kid say this!
Goa Kingdom!

01:24:27.500 --> 01:24:30.680
No matter how many times you run,
you can't get away, Sabo!

01:24:33.360 --> 01:24:37.880
Ace. Luffy.
You guys are okay, aren't you?

01:24:38.150 --> 01:24:39.760
I wish I could see you.

01:24:40.670 --> 01:24:42.910
This place is like a birdcage.

01:24:43.450 --> 01:24:46.620
I don't think I can stand
living in this country

01:24:46.620 --> 01:24:48.770
filled with stale air of rotten people.

01:24:50.040 --> 01:24:54.270
What is freedom? Where can I find it?

01:24:55.880 --> 01:24:58.760
THE DAY OF THE WORLD NOBLE'S ARRIVAL

01:24:59.070 --> 01:25:01.750
Hey, there is a ship leaving port
on a day like this!

01:25:04.140 --> 01:25:06.240
It's a child!
There's a child on the ship!

01:25:08.740 --> 01:25:11.920
What a nice day!
It's perfect for setting sail!

01:25:12.230 --> 01:25:15.590
Oh no! That's mine!
Somebody stole my fish boat!

01:25:15.590 --> 01:25:19.340
Could it be Sabo on that ship?

01:25:23.990 --> 01:25:26.180
The Government's ship is here!

01:25:26.240 --> 01:25:29.730
The ship is huge!
I might get tossed about by the waves.

01:25:30.280 --> 01:25:31.270
Let's get away.

01:25:36.000 --> 01:25:36.900
Sabo!

01:25:37.050 --> 01:25:38.900
There is a child on the ship!

01:25:38.900 --> 01:25:43.380
When someone flies a black flag,
he's a pirate regardless of who he is-eh.

01:25:43.380 --> 01:25:47.660
But most importantly,
a commoner shouldn't cross the path of my ship!!

01:25:49.020 --> 01:25:51.050
Damn! Why did they shoot me?!

01:26:13.620 --> 01:26:14.520
Sabo is...

01:26:16.290 --> 01:26:17.480
Stop lying, you fool!

01:26:18.000 --> 01:26:20.070
Don't even joke about it!

01:26:20.320 --> 01:26:24.840
I'm not lying or joking about it!
It was so sudden...

01:26:26.580 --> 01:26:29.200
Where is the guy who killed Sabo now?!

01:26:29.270 --> 01:26:31.040
I'm gonna kill him!

01:26:31.460 --> 01:26:33.670
Stop it, you little shit!

01:26:33.670 --> 01:26:37.650
Sabo was killed by this country!
This world!

01:26:37.650 --> 01:26:39.800
What can you do about it?!

01:26:42.450 --> 01:26:43.970
Dammit! Let go of me!

01:26:49.910 --> 01:26:53.940
Boss! We just got a letter from Sabo!

01:26:53.940 --> 01:26:55.750
TO MY BROTHERS
FROM SABO

01:26:58.250 --> 01:27:05.120
"Ace, Luffy, when you get this letter,
I'll already be out on the sea."

01:27:05.680 --> 01:27:09.530
"Things led to things and I decided
to set out to sea before you."

01:27:09.600 --> 01:27:12.950
"My destination will be anywhere but here.

01:27:13.360 --> 01:27:16.540
There, I'll become stronger
and become a pirate!"

01:27:16.600 --> 01:27:19.210
"The three of us have to become
the freest pirates ever

01:27:19.210 --> 01:27:21.620
then let's meet up again somewhere."

01:27:22.160 --> 01:27:26.430
"Somewhere on the big and open sea!
Definitely, someday!"

01:27:27.030 --> 01:27:31.600
"By the way, Ace, which one of us
do you think is the bigger brother?"

01:27:31.910 --> 01:27:34.670
"Two big brothers and one little brother.

01:27:35.120 --> 01:27:36.950
It's odd but our brotherhood is my treasure."

01:27:39.880 --> 01:27:43.440
"Luffy is still a weak crybaby but..."

01:27:44.740 --> 01:27:48.420
"...he is our little brother
so take good care of him!"

01:27:58.690 --> 01:28:01.120
How much longer
are you gonna lie there?

01:28:01.900 --> 01:28:07.380
A-Ace... I...
I wanna become stronger!

01:28:07.660 --> 01:28:12.600
So I can protect anything or anyone!
I don't have to lose anybody!

01:28:13.910 --> 01:28:15.910
I beg you!

01:28:16.830 --> 01:28:19.520
Ace, please don't die!

01:28:20.210 --> 01:28:21.890
Cut it out!

01:28:22.210 --> 01:28:24.810
Listen carefully, Luffy!

01:28:25.470 --> 01:28:29.510
I promise that I'll never die!

01:28:30.470 --> 01:28:33.490
How can I leave a wimpy brother
like you behind?

01:28:34.140 --> 01:28:35.870
Uh-huh! Uh-huh!

01:28:36.100 --> 01:28:41.320
So listen, Luffy.
We have to live without leaving any regrets.

01:28:42.070 --> 01:28:42.960
Uh-huh.

01:28:43.540 --> 01:28:47.550
We gotta go out to sea someday
and live as we like.

01:28:48.450 --> 01:28:51.000
Freer than anyone else.

01:28:54.220 --> 01:28:57.360
The fighting competition
in the Corrida Colosseum!

01:28:57.360 --> 01:28:59.350
The final!

01:29:02.540 --> 01:29:06.940
The contenders will enter at any moment!
Who's gonna come in first?!

01:29:20.060 --> 01:29:21.690
It's him!

01:29:21.690 --> 01:29:23.540
The man who has risen to
prominence in this competition!

01:29:24.000 --> 01:29:27.870
Here comes our favorite - Lucy!

01:29:30.740 --> 01:29:33.800
Watch over me, Ace!

01:29:36.060 --> 01:29:40.770
Now, they're all there!
These four winners from the first round!

01:29:40.770 --> 01:29:43.350
And the man who is going to fight them is...

01:29:44.710 --> 01:29:48.420
He saved this country along
with Donquixote Doflamingo,

01:29:48.420 --> 01:29:50.530
and is one of the top
executives of the Family!

01:29:50.810 --> 01:29:53.490
Mr. Diamante!

01:29:55.600 --> 01:30:01.750
The winner of this round will get
a Logia Devil Fruit, the most powerful type.

01:30:01.750 --> 01:30:03.880
The Flare-Flare Fruit!

01:30:05.310 --> 01:30:07.400
The rules of the final are...

01:30:08.120 --> 01:30:10.050
Don't start!

01:30:10.050 --> 01:30:12.420
Redo the Block D match!

01:30:12.420 --> 01:30:15.220
We couldn't have been beaten by
a little tramp like her!

01:30:19.380 --> 01:30:22.520
Don't ruin my event!

01:30:24.190 --> 01:30:27.240
I ate the Flutter-Flutter Fruit and
became a flag human!

01:30:27.630 --> 01:30:28.900
Lock.

01:30:29.400 --> 01:30:30.900
Corrida Glaive!

01:30:38.640 --> 01:30:39.410
Wh-What the...?!

01:30:41.810 --> 01:30:43.750
I-It's flying!

01:30:52.860 --> 01:30:55.590
Did you guys see how it attacked?!

01:30:56.070 --> 01:30:58.860
The deadliest Fighting Fish
from different schools

01:30:58.860 --> 01:31:02.050
will try to kill the contenders in the ring!

01:31:02.050 --> 01:31:06.190
And one of them has the
Flare-Flare Fruit on its back!

01:31:06.650 --> 01:31:08.550
The rules are simple!

01:31:08.550 --> 01:31:12.820
The one who gets it and remains standing
in the ring will be the champion!

01:31:15.010 --> 01:31:16.030
I see.

01:31:18.050 --> 01:31:19.630
Sounds like fun!

01:31:19.630 --> 01:31:22.370
You can't have the Flare-Flare Fruit!

01:31:23.060 --> 01:31:26.040
All right! It's gonna start soon!
A scramble for the Devil Fruit!

01:31:26.040 --> 01:31:28.380
A death match involving the Fighting Fish!

01:31:30.200 --> 01:31:33.720
I haven't done this kind of thing for so long.
I'm excited!

01:32:26.710 --> 01:32:28.520
You bastard!

01:32:39.800 --> 01:32:41.180
Lock!

01:32:53.690 --> 01:32:55.510
Wow! That was close!

01:33:13.030 --> 01:33:14.610
Barrier!

01:33:28.140 --> 01:33:29.060
There it is!

01:33:42.120 --> 01:33:43.570
I got it!

01:34:12.350 --> 01:34:14.880
This ring is a pain...

01:34:16.310 --> 01:34:18.200
It's getting exciting!

01:34:20.240 --> 01:34:21.930
Is that the entrance to the palace?

01:34:22.070 --> 01:34:25.190
Shh! Don't let the guards find you.

01:34:25.190 --> 01:34:27.010
Gum-Gum...

01:34:27.190 --> 01:34:30.220
...Giant Pistol!

01:34:30.620 --> 01:34:32.440
What the hell is he doing?!

01:34:32.910 --> 01:34:34.020
Let's burst in!

01:34:37.460 --> 01:34:41.360
This is the front entrance of the Rampart Tower!
It's Straw Hat Luffy!

01:34:43.080 --> 01:34:46.030
Lucy dodges easily!
Only he can move like that!

01:34:46.320 --> 01:34:47.990
What is he talking about?

01:34:48.220 --> 01:34:49.660
Outta my way!

01:34:49.970 --> 01:34:51.970
I-It's no mistake!

01:34:52.370 --> 01:34:56.920
He came in and stirred things
up in this event! Lucy!

01:34:58.480 --> 01:35:04.090
Then, who is the guy fighting at the Colosseum?!
What the hell is going on?!

01:35:05.430 --> 01:35:08.560
It's going for Burgess this time!

01:35:08.240 --> 01:35:10.680
Shockwave...

01:35:11.500 --> 01:35:13.210
...Elbow!

01:35:18.680 --> 01:35:20.840
Th-There you go!

01:35:20.840 --> 01:35:23.110
Burgess's Shockwave Elbow!

01:35:23.110 --> 01:35:26.320
It blasted a massive hole
in the spectator area!

01:35:26.320 --> 01:35:28.910
This man is Jesus Burgess!

01:35:28.910 --> 01:35:32.040
He's one of the Ten Titanic
Captains who support

01:35:32.040 --> 01:35:34.410
the upstart pirate - Blackbeard!

01:35:34.410 --> 01:35:37.040
--That bastard!
--Don't involve the audience!

01:35:38.770 --> 01:35:42.530
Oh, there is the Fighting Fish
carrying the Devil Fruit!

01:35:42.530 --> 01:35:43.550
It's going for...

01:35:43.560 --> 01:35:44.950
...Rebecca!

01:35:46.280 --> 01:35:47.800
I've gotta cut the chain at least!

01:35:53.410 --> 01:35:55.040
Yes! I've got you!

01:35:55.040 --> 01:35:57.600
You can't have it, Straw Hat!

01:36:03.630 --> 01:36:06.490
I'm gonna bring you down
along with that fish!

01:36:06.630 --> 01:36:09.490
--Run!
--He's gonna do it again!

01:36:09.490 --> 01:36:11.410
How smart of you to stand behind me!

01:36:11.560 --> 01:36:13.200
Lucy had no time to run!

01:36:14.080 --> 01:36:15.500
He's not gonna try to get away? Lucy!

01:36:15.650 --> 01:36:17.250
Shockwave...

01:36:19.520 --> 01:36:21.210
Dragon Claw!

01:36:22.170 --> 01:36:23.880
...Elbow!

01:36:38.960 --> 01:36:43.360
Oh my! Burgess's armor has
shattered into pieces!

01:36:43.710 --> 01:36:47.240
They're not gonna just give it up, huh?

01:36:47.240 --> 01:36:50.530
--Where is Kin'emon?!
--He headed for a place called the Toy House!

01:36:50.530 --> 01:36:51.420
Okay!

01:36:56.640 --> 01:36:58.310
--What the...!
--Pica!

01:36:58.540 --> 01:37:00.790
Be careful!
He's a top executive of the Family!

01:37:03.780 --> 01:37:06.970
Luffy, take her and go on!

01:37:06.970 --> 01:37:10.010
I'm gonna cut this stone guy!

01:37:10.160 --> 01:37:15.930
Rebecca can't do anything against
Diamante's overwhelming power!

01:37:16.160 --> 01:37:17.160
Damn!

01:37:17.160 --> 01:37:20.870
--Hey, Musclemelon!
--No, I'm Bartolomeo...

01:37:21.180 --> 01:37:23.480
--You protect her!
--What?!

01:37:23.630 --> 01:37:24.270
That's...

01:37:24.500 --> 01:37:29.300
GLADIUS - A POP-POP FRUIT EATER

01:37:24.660 --> 01:37:27.200
I ate the Pop-Pop Fruit and
became a rupture human!

01:37:27.200 --> 01:37:31.700
I can detonate my own body. And...

01:37:32.660 --> 01:37:34.280
...inorganic objects as well.

01:37:34.280 --> 01:37:36.040
Get blown to pieces!

01:37:36.450 --> 01:37:37.900
Jet Stamp!

01:37:38.940 --> 01:37:41.900
Soldier! Where are Franky and the others?

01:37:41.900 --> 01:37:44.250
I'm here to take down Doflamingo!

01:37:44.250 --> 01:37:45.800
Straw Hat! We gotta go!

01:37:46.820 --> 01:37:48.760
Violet! Damn you...

01:37:48.820 --> 01:37:49.970
Hurry to the 2nd floor!

01:37:50.110 --> 01:37:51.860
How could you...

01:37:53.490 --> 01:37:55.570
...betray Young Master-sama!

01:37:55.920 --> 01:37:57.180
Helmet Pop!

01:37:58.960 --> 01:37:59.850
Oh no!

01:38:00.830 --> 01:38:01.850
The 2nd floor, right?!

01:38:03.040 --> 01:38:04.010
That must be it!

01:38:05.550 --> 01:38:06.520
Where did they go?!

01:38:07.960 --> 01:38:10.070
There are some cracks in the
basement of the Colosseum!

01:38:10.070 --> 01:38:11.990
This place won't last until it's over!

01:38:12.140 --> 01:38:13.990
Shockwave Elbow!

01:38:16.010 --> 01:38:17.080
Nice!

01:38:18.020 --> 01:38:21.530
Boy! We made it straight to our destination!

01:38:21.530 --> 01:38:25.000
Hey, why do we have to hide?! Mingo is there!

01:38:26.110 --> 01:38:28.560
What's wrong? You look pale.

01:38:28.560 --> 01:38:30.630
The Little People of the Tontatta...

01:38:30.990 --> 01:38:34.910
TREBOL - A STICK-STICK FRUIT EATER

01:38:31.050 --> 01:38:34.890
...have been beaten up by Trebol,
a top executive of the Family!

01:38:34.890 --> 01:38:36.030
What?!

01:38:36.350 --> 01:38:38.170
My friend should be with them!

01:38:38.370 --> 01:38:39.140
He's there.

01:38:39.450 --> 01:38:43.230
The one with a long nose...
But Sugar is about to...

01:38:43.420 --> 01:38:47.770
As long as he's there, it's gonna be fine!
I'm sure Usopp will take care of it!

01:38:48.090 --> 01:38:50.360
He's not even conscious now.

01:38:50.740 --> 01:38:52.270
Don't do it, Sugar!

01:38:52.270 --> 01:38:54.860
You were trying so hard
to make me eat this but...

01:38:53.180 --> 01:38:57.510
SUGAR - A HOBBY-HOBBY FRUIT EATER

01:38:55.240 --> 01:38:57.490
...you can have this poison grape back.

01:38:57.640 --> 01:39:01.330
--Oh, the Tatababasco grape!
--Our only hope!

01:39:01.820 --> 01:39:03.320
You eat this.

01:39:04.660 --> 01:39:05.850
Drop dead.

01:39:28.210 --> 01:39:30.320
S-Sugar!

01:39:33.170 --> 01:39:35.440
I'm sorry, Doffy!

01:39:35.440 --> 01:39:36.410
Trebol!

01:39:36.560 --> 01:39:39.700
Sugar has passed out!

01:39:39.850 --> 01:39:43.620
What? Hey, is this some kind of joke?!

01:39:44.640 --> 01:39:47.610
What is happening here?!

01:39:48.390 --> 01:39:52.130
The toys are turning into humans
one after the other!

01:39:56.320 --> 01:39:57.970
Hey! Keep working!

01:39:57.970 --> 01:40:00.950
Please don't! Please don't!

01:40:02.250 --> 01:40:03.160
What?

01:40:03.160 --> 01:40:06.850
How dare you push us around all this time...

01:40:07.880 --> 01:40:10.710
Dressrosa is in turmoil!

01:40:17.300 --> 01:40:20.530
--Come on out, Doflamingo!
--I'm gonna kill you!

01:40:20.710 --> 01:40:24.050
--Doflamingo is a devil!
--Take down Doflamingo!

01:40:24.050 --> 01:40:27.420
--How dare you call yourself a king?!
--You fooled us!

01:40:27.800 --> 01:40:32.340
A decade...
We've worked hard on this for a decade!

01:40:32.480 --> 01:40:33.710
Oh? Where did the soldier go?!

01:40:33.860 --> 01:40:35.010
It's him!

01:40:35.490 --> 01:40:36.880
Brother Kyros!

01:40:37.070 --> 01:40:37.930
Who is he?

01:40:38.650 --> 01:40:41.640
He's the former commander of
the King Riku Army - Kyros!

01:40:42.120 --> 01:40:45.850
The strongest gladiator
in the history of the Colosseum!

01:40:45.850 --> 01:40:48.390
That's the old man the statue is of!

01:40:48.640 --> 01:40:51.700
And he's also Rebecca's biological father!

01:40:52.290 --> 01:40:55.320
I'm here to take back the real Dressrosa!

01:40:55.320 --> 01:40:56.950
Let's follow him!

01:40:57.800 --> 01:40:59.570
You bastards!

01:40:59.570 --> 01:41:03.680
E-Even I don't know how to
explain this situation!

01:41:03.680 --> 01:41:06.750
Hey! How much longer are you gonna cry?!
Am I a babysitter?!

01:41:07.060 --> 01:41:08.080
It's not that!

01:41:08.600 --> 01:41:11.500
I had a father!

01:41:12.470 --> 01:41:13.920
I just remember!

01:41:13.940 --> 01:41:18.510
I guess that's the plot that's been
undermining the country, Rebecca.

01:41:19.320 --> 01:41:20.110
Lucy...

01:41:20.110 --> 01:41:22.460
Things always have a core.

01:41:22.460 --> 01:41:26.160
And if you can strike it,
you can turn any situation around.

01:41:26.600 --> 01:41:28.920
Even the ring has one. A core.

01:41:29.520 --> 01:41:31.850
Let's just finish up this fight.

01:41:32.840 --> 01:41:34.860
Dragon Claw Fist! Dragon...

01:41:35.100 --> 01:41:36.560
...Breath!

01:41:39.760 --> 01:41:41.660
The ring has exploded!

01:41:41.720 --> 01:41:46.540
Lucy's unbelievable attack!
The ring is sinking!

01:41:46.800 --> 01:41:47.870
It's floating!

01:41:48.140 --> 01:41:50.040
You bastard! What did you do?!

01:41:50.310 --> 01:41:52.960
I gotta go somewhere! I'm gonna win this!

01:41:53.020 --> 01:41:57.640
The ring has totally collapsed!
Everybody, please evacuate immediately!

01:41:58.090 --> 01:41:59.510
You can't hold on to my neck!

01:42:01.360 --> 01:42:02.830
I'm losing my strength...

01:42:05.280 --> 01:42:06.180
I found it!

01:42:07.950 --> 01:42:11.640
Don't! We weren't gonna
give anyone that prize!

01:42:12.710 --> 01:42:15.270
It's Doffy's!

01:42:22.420 --> 01:42:25.360
Everybody's out of the ring! I'm the winner!

01:42:25.360 --> 01:42:26.290
What?!

01:42:26.290 --> 01:42:28.520
You said the one who gets
this will be the winner!

01:42:28.520 --> 01:42:30.000
It's all mine, isn't it?

01:42:30.140 --> 01:42:33.460
Th-The champion!

01:42:33.460 --> 01:42:39.010
Oh my! The one who got the Flare-Flare Fruit
by taking advantage of this mess is...

01:42:39.010 --> 01:42:42.070
...the biggest dark horse
of this competition!

01:42:43.000 --> 01:42:43.720
Disgusting!

01:42:44.620 --> 01:42:46.510
Lucy!

01:42:47.310 --> 01:42:51.140
Oh my great senpai! Help me, too!

01:42:51.480 --> 01:42:54.600
You're a man.
You have to take care of yourself!

01:42:54.600 --> 01:42:55.860
What?!

01:42:57.910 --> 01:43:00.360
Who are you really?

01:43:00.670 --> 01:43:04.200
My name is Sabo,
a member of the Revolutionary Army!

01:43:04.510 --> 01:43:06.280
What about the first Lucy?!

01:43:06.430 --> 01:43:08.300
He's a pirate who's worth 400 million

01:43:08.300 --> 01:43:10.660
and the man who'll become the
King of the Pirates someday!

01:43:10.660 --> 01:43:13.960
Straw Hat Luffy! He's my brother.

01:43:14.350 --> 01:43:16.210
I'm gonna make one more attack so watch out!

01:43:19.530 --> 01:43:21.920
Ow, it's hot!
I really can generate a fire!

01:43:22.150 --> 01:43:26.590
--He ate the Flare-Flare Fruit!
--Isn't he the guy from the Revolutionary Army?!

01:43:26.590 --> 01:43:30.680
No, it's just my imagination! It's not hot!
I am a fire now!

01:43:31.770 --> 01:43:35.680
Ace! I take over your ability!

01:43:36.430 --> 01:43:41.070
I never wanna go through that again. So...

01:43:41.550 --> 01:43:46.200
I will save Luffy's life that
you saved with your life!

01:43:47.800 --> 01:43:53.450
Luffy! You just take out your enemies in front of you
and become the King of the Pirates!

01:43:59.900 --> 01:44:01.300
I promise!

01:44:01.700 --> 01:44:05.130
I... I will never die!

01:44:11.700 --> 01:44:16.270
Ace!
We're gonna advance seeking freedom!

01:44:22.510 --> 01:44:23.530
Here I go!

01:44:28.850 --> 01:44:30.700
Fire Fist!

01:45:06.090 --> 01:45:10.510
The flame of life that I
reached out and touched

01:45:06.090 --> 01:45:10.510
te wo nobashite fureta inochi no hi yo

01:45:10.510 --> 01:45:12.970
It will never be extinguished

01:45:10.510 --> 01:45:12.970
keshite kienai

01:45:12.970 --> 01:45:18.060
Along with the bond we bound ourselves to

01:45:12.970 --> 01:45:18.060
chikatta kizuna to tomo ni

01:45:21.440 --> 01:45:26.400
In this time when lies look glittering

01:45:21.440 --> 01:45:26.400
uso ga kirameite mieru kono jidai ni

01:45:26.400 --> 01:45:31.950
We let the same wound soak in the same rain

01:45:26.400 --> 01:45:31.950
onaji kizu wo onaji ame ni nurashita

01:45:31.950 --> 01:45:36.080
Searching for the reason we were born

01:45:31.950 --> 01:45:36.080
umiotosareta imi wo sagashite

01:45:36.080 --> 01:45:42.670
The boys sang that they will defend freedom

01:45:36.080 --> 01:45:42.670
jiyuu wo mamoru to utatta shounen tachi yo

01:45:42.670 --> 01:45:47.840
I wasn't by myself, I wasn't afraid anymore

01:45:42.670 --> 01:45:47.840
hitori ja nakatta mou kowaku wa nakatta

01:45:47.840 --> 01:45:53.010
At the extremity of sorrow, you were there

01:45:47.840 --> 01:45:53.010
kanashimi no hate anata ga ita

01:45:53.010 --> 01:45:57.810
Liberator, let it be heard

01:45:53.010 --> 01:45:57.810
liberator narashite

01:45:57.810 --> 01:46:04.270
By my heart that's tired of crying

01:45:57.810 --> 01:46:04.270
nakitsukareta kokoro ni

01:46:04.270 --> 01:46:08.610
The song of liberation,
that voice of laughter

01:46:04.270 --> 01:46:08.610
kaihou no uta wo ano warau koe wo

01:46:08.610 --> 01:46:13.450
The liberator is you

01:46:08.610 --> 01:46:13.450
liberator wa anata

01:46:13.450 --> 01:46:19.830
There are no walls in this world

01:46:13.450 --> 01:46:19.830
kono sekai ni kabe wa nai

01:46:19.830 --> 01:46:24.380
Let the song of liberation be heard

01:46:19.830 --> 01:46:24.380
kaihou no uta wo

01:46:29.760 --> 01:46:32.090
Thank you, Luffy!

01:46:32.800 --> 01:46:35.680
I'm glad that you're alive!
